1
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:53,362
- This is your room, right?
- Yeah.

2
00:00:53,362 --> 00:00:54,530
(In Kwon and Jeong Yoon go to talk.)

3
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:56,231
- Let's talk inside.
- Sure.

4
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:59,301
I stopped by your room yesterday.

5
00:00:59,301 --> 00:01:00,069
I had no idea.

6
00:01:00,069 --> 00:01:01,403
I came by,

7
00:01:01,403 --> 00:01:04,239
but your mother said
you were talking to someone else.

8
00:01:04,239 --> 00:01:05,407
I asked if anyone was there.

9
00:01:05,674 --> 00:01:08,110
I heard about it from your mother.

10
00:01:08,110 --> 00:01:09,211
My mom?

11
00:01:09,745 --> 00:01:11,380
- Your mother.
- She helped them out.

12
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:12,881
Right. She said she told you.

13
00:01:12,881 --> 00:01:14,917
I was really surprised.

14
00:01:15,184 --> 00:01:18,887
Because we barely got to talk
the first time yesterday.

15
00:01:18,887 --> 00:01:22,091
Then the second time, I hadn't been there.

16
00:01:22,091 --> 00:01:23,792
Then I came again, but you weren't there.

17
00:01:23,792 --> 00:01:24,793
Right.

18
00:01:24,793 --> 00:01:26,495
- So...
- We kept missing each other.

19
00:01:28,998 --> 00:01:31,300
But I wouldn't have minded
if we kept missing each other.

20
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:32,368
Really?

21
00:01:32,368 --> 00:01:34,370
You were sulking. Of course, you minded.

22
00:01:34,370 --> 00:01:35,337
(Kim Yo Han, Lee Yo Won, Seo Jang Hoon)

23
00:01:35,337 --> 00:01:37,906
Mom came and told me...

24
00:01:37,906 --> 00:01:39,608
that you said I was now in second place.

25
00:01:39,608 --> 00:01:41,043
She told her everything.

26
00:01:41,043 --> 00:01:42,578
Well, that's because...

27
00:01:42,578 --> 00:01:44,079
(Flustered)

28
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:47,216
This was your mother's first question.

29
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:50,119
She asked how many women
I was interested in.

30
00:01:50,119 --> 00:01:51,987
I told her there were two,

31
00:01:51,987 --> 00:01:58,193
and Jeong Yoon is definitely one of them.

32
00:01:58,193 --> 00:02:02,031
When Mom came back,
she said that after talking to you,

33
00:02:02,031 --> 00:02:05,968
she thought
you and I clicked best in conversation.

34
00:02:05,968 --> 00:02:09,972
She thought
you'd relate best to what I value.

35
00:02:09,972 --> 00:02:12,841
She said you seemed incredibly grounded.

36
00:02:17,046 --> 00:02:18,781
Anyway,

37
00:02:19,682 --> 00:02:21,917
was there anything else you wanted to ask?

38
00:02:21,917 --> 00:02:22,885
Anything I was curious about?

39
00:02:22,885 --> 00:02:25,487
Anything you were curious
or worried about?

40
00:02:25,487 --> 00:02:27,489
What I wanted to know most was...

41
00:02:27,489 --> 00:02:30,125
- whether you liked anyone,
- Right.

42
00:02:30,125 --> 00:02:31,627
and whether I was one of them.

43
00:02:31,627 --> 00:02:33,162
Yeah, so I kept...

44
00:02:33,162 --> 00:02:35,264
wanting to have this conversation.

45
00:02:35,264 --> 00:02:38,367
Mom knew I wanted to talk to you,

46
00:02:38,367 --> 00:02:42,171
so she hula-hooped her heart out
to win a chat with you.

47
00:02:43,572 --> 00:02:46,742
Once again,
I have your mother to thank for this.

48
00:02:47,376 --> 00:02:49,445
The person I'm most
interested in right now...

49
00:02:49,445 --> 00:02:50,546
is Jeong Yoon.

50
00:02:51,180 --> 00:02:54,516
She assured me that she likes me too,

51
00:02:55,384 --> 00:02:58,153
and I think that gave me
the confidence to move forward.

52
00:02:58,754 --> 00:03:01,357
When she's nice to him,
she's his top choice.

53
00:03:01,357 --> 00:03:03,125
But the slightest thing goes wrong,

54
00:03:03,125 --> 00:03:04,393
and he says he likes her less.

55
00:03:04,393 --> 00:03:05,961
In Kwon is so passive.

56
00:03:05,961 --> 00:03:07,329
What's with him?

57
00:03:07,329 --> 00:03:09,732
If he likes her, he should just go for it.

58
00:03:09,732 --> 00:03:10,699
Exactly.

59
00:03:16,772 --> 00:03:21,143
(Morning of Day 4 at the camp)

60
00:03:22,378 --> 00:03:24,279
When your mother is around...

61
00:03:24,279 --> 00:03:26,248
You can't sleep in.
You have to get up early.

62
00:03:26,248 --> 00:03:28,384
Mothers wake up at five or six.

63
00:03:29,652 --> 00:03:32,254
(Seong Mo visits In Kwon's room
early in the morning.)

64
00:03:32,254 --> 00:03:33,455
- Are you ready?
- Yeah.

65
00:03:34,089 --> 00:03:35,858
Hey, these shoes...

66
00:03:35,858 --> 00:03:37,259
Which pair looks better?

67
00:03:37,793 --> 00:03:38,761
Try them both on.

68
00:03:40,629 --> 00:03:42,297
Since your pants are white,
I think brown is better.

69
00:03:42,297 --> 00:03:44,199
Black shoes with white pants
are a little...

70
00:03:44,199 --> 00:03:46,135
My mom always checked my outfits for me.

71
00:03:46,735 --> 00:03:47,936
I don't have a mom either.

72
00:03:50,305 --> 00:03:51,907
That's not what I meant.
My mom isn't here right now.

73
00:03:51,907 --> 00:03:53,709
(His mother's absence
feels greater today.)

74
00:03:54,310 --> 00:03:56,912
Are you still deciding among three people?

75
00:03:57,346 --> 00:03:59,114
I've pretty much made up my mind.

76
00:04:00,582 --> 00:04:02,785
Now that some time has passed
and we've talked more,

77
00:04:02,785 --> 00:04:06,622
I narrowed it down
to Do Yoon and Jeong Yoon.

78
00:04:08,357 --> 00:04:10,092
And between the two,

79
00:04:10,092 --> 00:04:13,195
I think I'm a little more drawn
to Jeong Yoon.

80
00:04:14,596 --> 00:04:15,898
We're into the same women.

81
00:04:15,898 --> 00:04:17,132
Really?

82
00:04:17,733 --> 00:04:18,801
They're the same two.

83
00:04:19,768 --> 00:04:20,969
Even their rankings are the same.

84
00:04:20,969 --> 00:04:23,238
Jeong Yoon is first,
and Do Yoon is second.

85
00:04:23,238 --> 00:04:26,709
- Even their second choice?
- Even that is the same.

86
00:04:26,709 --> 00:04:28,544
They're both in high demand.

87
00:04:29,345 --> 00:04:32,781
(The two learn
that they like the same women.)

88
00:04:33,082 --> 00:04:34,149
Hey,

89
00:04:35,617 --> 00:04:41,090
I've kept saying
you're my biggest competition.

90
00:04:42,424 --> 00:04:43,459
My instincts were right.

91
00:04:45,761 --> 00:04:46,895
You were on my radar.

92
00:04:48,297 --> 00:04:50,499
You've got to move fast
at a time like this,

93
00:04:50,499 --> 00:04:51,967
and go for your second choice.

94
00:04:53,602 --> 00:04:54,903
- Why?
- What if you lose both of them?

95
00:04:54,903 --> 00:04:56,071
No, because...

96
00:04:56,071 --> 00:04:57,306
that leaves an opening.

97
00:04:57,306 --> 00:04:59,708
You can swoop in before anyone else.

98
00:05:01,443 --> 00:05:06,315
(Meanwhile, Dong Young sits alone,
deep in thought.)

99
00:05:09,685 --> 00:05:10,919
Where is he going?

100
00:05:14,289 --> 00:05:17,026
(Dong Young visits Ha Yoon's room.)

101
00:05:17,292 --> 00:05:18,527
Again?

102
00:05:18,527 --> 00:05:19,528
He went back.

103
00:05:19,528 --> 00:05:20,529
(Good job)

104
00:05:22,931 --> 00:05:26,602
(Dong Young hesitates
outside the door for a while.)

105
00:05:28,937 --> 00:05:30,072
Is anyone there?

106
00:05:32,408 --> 00:05:33,575
Dong Young.

107
00:05:34,943 --> 00:05:35,978
Hi, Ha Yoon.

108
00:05:39,181 --> 00:05:39,948
There we go.

109
00:05:39,948 --> 00:05:41,517
That's it. This is it.

110
00:05:41,517 --> 00:05:43,218
I saw that look. It's a done deal.

111
00:05:43,752 --> 00:05:45,821
He's so sweet.

112
00:05:45,821 --> 00:05:47,323
"Hi, Ha Yoon."

113
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:49,558
Hi, Ha Yoon.

114
00:05:50,259 --> 00:05:51,894
It's over. Her expression says it all.

115
00:05:54,196 --> 00:05:55,331
Can we talk?

116
00:05:55,331 --> 00:05:56,899
Of course. Just give me a moment.

117
00:05:56,899 --> 00:05:58,067
That heart-fluttering mix
of formal and casual speech.

118
00:06:00,536 --> 00:06:04,273
(Ha Yoon follows Dong Young out.)

119
00:06:06,475 --> 00:06:07,910
I don't know what's planned for today,

120
00:06:07,910 --> 00:06:10,813
but I wanted to talk before that.

121
00:06:10,813 --> 00:06:11,814
Sure.

122
00:06:13,282 --> 00:06:16,151
I'm not sure how you took what I said,

123
00:06:17,353 --> 00:06:22,658
but I've been thinking a lot since then.

124
00:06:22,658 --> 00:06:24,660
It's been weighing on me.

125
00:06:26,328 --> 00:06:27,896
It probably showed.

126
00:06:27,896 --> 00:06:30,866
I tried avoiding you on purpose...

127
00:06:32,067 --> 00:06:34,703
and pretending I didn't care.

128
00:06:35,771 --> 00:06:37,606
See? He reaches out first,
and everything works out.

129
00:06:37,606 --> 00:06:38,540
Right.

130
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:41,110
That just made me feel even worse.

131
00:06:42,645 --> 00:06:46,448
I didn't come out yesterday
intending to end things.

132
00:06:46,448 --> 00:06:48,250
I meant, "Let's talk about this issue,"

133
00:06:48,250 --> 00:06:51,754
and, "These are my values."

134
00:06:51,754 --> 00:06:55,557
I must have caught you off guard.

135
00:06:55,557 --> 00:06:57,192
I was a little...

136
00:06:57,192 --> 00:06:58,827
too harsh.

137
00:06:59,561 --> 00:07:04,333
Instead of ending things so quickly,

138
00:07:04,333 --> 00:07:06,902
since we still had time,

139
00:07:06,902 --> 00:07:09,605
I wish we'd first talked about
finding a way forward...

140
00:07:12,541 --> 00:07:13,842
and I wish I'd asked...

141
00:07:16,245 --> 00:07:18,514
whether you felt it was worth trying.

142
00:07:20,015 --> 00:07:22,885
That's what I wish we'd done.

143
00:07:24,653 --> 00:07:26,155
I had some regrets too.

144
00:07:28,857 --> 00:07:31,460
I thought you felt
uncomfortable around me...

145
00:07:32,661 --> 00:07:33,962
when I first heard what you said.

146
00:07:35,164 --> 00:07:40,569
I wanted to say,
"I'll move. What's the problem?"

147
00:07:40,569 --> 00:07:44,740
But I worried that might put
even more pressure on you.

148
00:07:45,741 --> 00:07:51,113
I think I was trying
to put your feelings first.

149
00:07:52,047 --> 00:07:56,318
If that's the only thing holding us back,

150
00:07:56,318 --> 00:08:00,723
we could've talked it through
before deciding.

151
00:08:01,056 --> 00:08:02,591
Because there are five men here,

152
00:08:02,591 --> 00:08:05,794
but you're the only one
I have just one concern about.

153
00:08:10,899 --> 00:08:12,968
It was harder on me than I expected,

154
00:08:14,203 --> 00:08:15,971
so thank you for reaching out first.

155
00:08:17,573 --> 00:08:19,375
I felt so relieved.

156
00:08:19,375 --> 00:08:22,144
I'd wanted to speak first,

157
00:08:22,144 --> 00:08:25,214
but I was grateful that Dong Young did.

158
00:08:26,048 --> 00:08:29,251
I realized it wasn't
that we saw things differently,

159
00:08:29,251 --> 00:08:33,288
but that we were starting
to see eye to eye.

160
00:08:34,189 --> 00:08:36,025
That made me happy.

161
00:08:36,592 --> 00:08:39,628
In just a few days,

162
00:08:39,628 --> 00:08:42,064
they met, broke up, and got back together.

163
00:08:42,064 --> 00:08:44,500
- They did it all.
- Exactly.

164
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:47,603
Let me just say this.

165
00:08:47,603 --> 00:08:48,637
Those two are going to end up together.

166
00:08:48,637 --> 00:08:51,707
I don't think her mother will be thrilled.

167
00:08:51,707 --> 00:08:54,576
I have a feeling she might...

168
00:08:54,576 --> 00:08:55,744
be somewhat against it.

169
00:08:56,779 --> 00:09:00,449
(An alert sounds throughout the camp.)

170
00:09:00,783 --> 00:09:04,253
We will now begin the women's-choice date.

171
00:09:04,253 --> 00:09:05,387
No.

172
00:09:06,088 --> 00:09:07,356
I see.

173
00:09:07,356 --> 00:09:08,957
Right away?

174
00:09:08,957 --> 00:09:12,094
It's about time
they started making up their minds.

175
00:09:12,094 --> 00:09:13,696
Right.

176
00:09:14,063 --> 00:09:17,833
(The men gather in front of the house.)

177
00:09:22,538 --> 00:09:25,607
(The women will choose their dates.)

178
00:09:25,607 --> 00:09:27,443
(Sigh)

179
00:09:28,010 --> 00:09:29,144
(Sigh)

180
00:09:29,144 --> 00:09:31,313
Why are you both sighing?

181
00:09:32,815 --> 00:09:33,983
What's wrong?

182
00:09:33,983 --> 00:09:35,050
Your sigh will make the ground cave in.

183
00:09:35,884 --> 00:09:37,052
What is it?

184
00:09:37,386 --> 00:09:40,656
Today, you'll go
on a meet-the-parents date.

185
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:45,661
I'd better make a good impression.

186
00:09:47,629 --> 00:09:50,933
Today, you'll go
on a meet-the-parents date.

187
00:09:51,767 --> 00:09:53,535
(Gasp)

188
00:09:53,535 --> 00:09:54,536
Meet the parents?

189
00:09:55,004 --> 00:09:56,472
A meet-the-parents date?

190
00:09:56,739 --> 00:10:00,409
The women will come out
one at a time when called,

191
00:10:00,409 --> 00:10:04,947
and stand beside the man
they want to go on the date with.

192
00:10:06,582 --> 00:10:07,916
On the meet-the-parents date,

193
00:10:07,916 --> 00:10:11,086
the mothers who went out earlier
will return,

194
00:10:11,086 --> 00:10:14,957
and the couples will dine
with their mothers.

195
00:10:14,957 --> 00:10:17,326
So they have to choose their dates...

196
00:10:17,326 --> 00:10:19,428
knowing their mothers will join them.

197
00:10:19,428 --> 00:10:20,462
That's another factor.

198
00:10:20,462 --> 00:10:22,798
It'd be sad to get zero votes.

199
00:10:22,798 --> 00:10:23,666
Right.

200
00:10:23,666 --> 00:10:25,668
You'd have to eat alone with your mom.

201
00:10:26,568 --> 00:10:27,703
I was so nervous.

202
00:10:28,537 --> 00:10:30,406
I think it was
the most nerve-racking moment yet.

203
00:10:30,739 --> 00:10:35,044
I regretted not being more proactive.

204
00:10:35,044 --> 00:10:38,480
That regret made me anxious.

205
00:10:38,981 --> 00:10:42,551
I hoped at least one woman
would come to me.

206
00:10:43,485 --> 00:10:46,155
If I'd known,
I'd have worn a knee-length skirt.

207
00:10:46,155 --> 00:10:46,922
Me too.

208
00:10:46,922 --> 00:10:48,824
This is hard.

209
00:10:50,225 --> 00:10:52,194
Ahn Do Yoon, please come out first.

210
00:10:52,194 --> 00:10:53,395
I'm last again.

211
00:10:53,395 --> 00:10:55,030
(First to choose is Ahn Do Yoon.)

212
00:10:55,898 --> 00:11:01,737
(Who will Do Yoon choose for the date?)

213
00:11:03,872 --> 00:11:05,507
This is hard.

214
00:11:05,507 --> 00:11:07,176
I think she'll go to In Kwon.

215
00:11:07,176 --> 00:11:08,177
I think she'll choose Ye Chan.

216
00:11:09,311 --> 00:11:13,015
With Do Yoon,
the one-on-one conversation...

217
00:11:13,015 --> 00:11:15,384
with her mother went smoothly yesterday.

218
00:11:15,384 --> 00:11:17,619
And I thought she was interested in me,

219
00:11:17,619 --> 00:11:19,555
so I thought I had a good chance.

220
00:11:20,856 --> 00:11:25,260
I thought,
"Maybe Do Yoon will come to me."

221
00:11:26,662 --> 00:11:28,464
Ye Chan and In Kwon.

222
00:11:29,565 --> 00:11:31,367
With Ye Chan,

223
00:11:31,367 --> 00:11:35,004
I don't see any major practical obstacles.

224
00:11:35,004 --> 00:11:38,440
With In Kwon, I can't ignore our age gap.

225
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:40,309
Right. There is an age gap.

226
00:11:40,309 --> 00:11:42,611
- But I'm strangely drawn to him.
- What?

227
00:11:42,611 --> 00:11:43,512
I'm drawn to him.

228
00:11:46,849 --> 00:11:47,850
What do I do?

229
00:11:53,389 --> 00:12:00,029
(Who will Ahn Do Yoon choose?)

230
00:12:04,299 --> 00:12:05,367
Hello.

231
00:12:05,367 --> 00:12:07,803
(Ahn Do Yoon chooses Kwon Ye Chan.)

232
00:12:07,803 --> 00:12:09,972
- Yes, Ye Chan.
- I knew it.

233
00:12:12,775 --> 00:12:13,842
You're nervous, aren't you?

234
00:12:14,443 --> 00:12:15,644
Because you came up from behind.

235
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:19,882
Will it be another group date today?

236
00:12:20,582 --> 00:12:21,950
I want a one-on-one date.

237
00:12:22,885 --> 00:12:25,788
My mother won the challenge...

238
00:12:25,788 --> 00:12:27,656
and told me she'd talked to Ye Chan.

239
00:12:27,656 --> 00:12:31,327
Since my mom chose him
and it's a meet-the-parents date,

240
00:12:31,327 --> 00:12:34,263
I wanted to talk to him too,
so I chose Ye Chan.

241
00:12:34,763 --> 00:12:36,699
I was very grateful.

242
00:12:36,999 --> 00:12:38,667
But...

243
00:12:38,667 --> 00:12:41,337
I was also thinking about Jeong Yoon,

244
00:12:41,337 --> 00:12:44,306
so part of me wanted to wait...

245
00:12:44,306 --> 00:12:45,941
until all five women had chosen.

246
00:12:47,176 --> 00:12:48,377
But...

247
00:12:50,980 --> 00:12:54,883
Do Yoon's choice is complicated...

248
00:12:54,883 --> 00:12:58,554
because those two are both interested
in someone else.

249
00:12:58,554 --> 00:13:00,789
They're a perfect example of that.

250
00:13:00,789 --> 00:13:04,093
- Both of their top choices...
- Their top choice is Jeong Yoon.

251
00:13:04,093 --> 00:13:06,228
She isn't their first choice.

252
00:13:06,228 --> 00:13:09,198
If one of them changed course,

253
00:13:10,032 --> 00:13:11,867
four people could be happy.

254
00:13:11,867 --> 00:13:12,835
Right.

255
00:13:14,503 --> 00:13:16,438
Kim Da Hye, please come out.

256
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:22,544
I'm so curious to see...

257
00:13:22,544 --> 00:13:23,479
who Da Hye will choose.

258
00:13:23,479 --> 00:13:26,515
I'm also really curious
to see where Da Hye's heart is now.

259
00:13:26,515 --> 00:13:27,483
My heart is pounding.

260
00:13:30,052 --> 00:13:31,286
Gosh.

261
00:13:31,854 --> 00:13:33,322
This is tough.

262
00:13:33,322 --> 00:13:36,892
Both Shin Woo and Ye Chan
were in the running.

263
00:13:36,892 --> 00:13:40,262
I still wanted to talk to them both more.
But for this date,

264
00:13:40,262 --> 00:13:44,199
I felt that choosing who to spend
this time with was especially important.

265
00:13:44,199 --> 00:13:47,436
So it was a very difficult choice.

266
00:13:48,137 --> 00:13:52,675
She flirted pretty boldly with Ye Chan,

267
00:13:52,675 --> 00:13:54,343
but it felt like he turned her down.

268
00:13:54,343 --> 00:13:55,944
A little.

269
00:13:55,944 --> 00:13:58,480
Does she go back to where she started...

270
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,448
or...

271
00:14:02,151 --> 00:14:04,153
What do I do?

272
00:14:05,988 --> 00:14:08,157
That must be really hard.

273
00:14:15,464 --> 00:14:18,233
If she goes to Shin Woo now,

274
00:14:18,233 --> 00:14:19,802
she's practically sealing the deal.

275
00:14:21,603 --> 00:14:26,008
(Who will Kim Da Hye choose?)

276
00:14:28,577 --> 00:14:31,146
(Kim Da Hye chooses Kang Shin Woo.)

277
00:14:31,146 --> 00:14:32,815
Now, Shin Woo can't let her go.

278
00:14:32,815 --> 00:14:34,383
He can't

279
00:14:35,184 --> 00:14:36,085
It's good to see you.

280
00:14:38,721 --> 00:14:42,992
I felt like I was soaring.

281
00:14:43,392 --> 00:14:45,361
I thought she'd choose someone else.

282
00:14:45,361 --> 00:14:48,664
I couldn't believe she'd come to me again.

283
00:14:48,664 --> 00:14:50,432
I'm so happy right now.

284
00:14:50,432 --> 00:14:52,267
She gets prettier every time I see her.

285
00:14:53,469 --> 00:14:56,939
That completely...

286
00:14:56,939 --> 00:14:59,708
set Shin Woo's heart on fire.

287
00:15:00,142 --> 00:15:03,512
You look lovely again today.

288
00:15:04,013 --> 00:15:05,047
Thank you.

289
00:15:08,384 --> 00:15:09,551
(Third to choose is Yang Ha Yoon.)

290
00:15:09,551 --> 00:15:11,920
I'm curious about Ha Yoon too.

291
00:15:20,496 --> 00:15:23,165
I'll keep asking myself...

292
00:15:24,133 --> 00:15:26,635
whether my feelings are strong enough...

293
00:15:27,436 --> 00:15:29,104
to overcome the long-distance issue
that worries me most.

294
00:15:30,439 --> 00:15:33,609
I hoped Ha Yoon would come to me.

295
00:15:45,220 --> 00:15:46,522
(Yang Ha Yoon chooses Kim Dong Young.)

296
00:15:46,522 --> 00:15:48,190
- You came.
- This feels right.

297
00:15:48,190 --> 00:15:49,058
Hello.

298
00:15:55,230 --> 00:15:57,666
What acupuncture point helps
with a racing heart?

299
00:15:59,201 --> 00:16:00,636
Yes.

300
00:16:01,236 --> 00:16:02,371
Yes.

301
00:16:02,905 --> 00:16:04,540
Acupuncture...

302
00:16:04,907 --> 00:16:06,809
I think I need a needle right now too.

303
00:16:10,145 --> 00:16:11,413
He's beside himself with joy.

304
00:16:11,413 --> 00:16:13,082
She likes him.

305
00:16:14,783 --> 00:16:16,352
Can't you hear my heart pounding?

306
00:16:17,119 --> 00:16:18,487
No. I can only hear the drone.

307
00:16:18,487 --> 00:16:19,555
Really? What a relief.

308
00:16:22,324 --> 00:16:24,360
I'm sure it was written all over my face.

309
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:26,895
My heart was racing so fast
it almost hurt.

310
00:16:26,895 --> 00:16:28,530
I was thrilled and so happy.

311
00:16:28,797 --> 00:16:32,434
He's more direct
than anyone I've ever met,

312
00:16:32,434 --> 00:16:36,872
and I loved how manly and assertive he is.

313
00:16:37,072 --> 00:16:39,108
You look beautiful.

314
00:16:39,108 --> 00:16:40,109
Thank you.

315
00:16:41,176 --> 00:16:43,345
I think my mother will like you too.

316
00:16:43,345 --> 00:16:44,680
- Really?
- Yes.

317
00:16:45,180 --> 00:16:48,517
(As Dong Young basks in his joy)

318
00:16:49,218 --> 00:16:51,954
(Lee In Kwon, 0 votes)

319
00:16:51,954 --> 00:16:54,957
(Moon Seong Mo, 0 votes)

320
00:16:56,158 --> 00:16:57,326
(Only two choices remain.)

321
00:16:57,326 --> 00:16:58,661
There are only two women left.

322
00:17:00,162 --> 00:17:05,034
(Who will receive the final two votes?)

323
00:17:05,668 --> 00:17:09,605
(Fourth to choose is Lee Kang Hyeon.)

324
00:17:10,806 --> 00:17:13,342
I couldn't have a family date...

325
00:17:13,342 --> 00:17:14,943
with someone I'd never even spoken to.

326
00:17:14,943 --> 00:17:16,412
So it wasn't an easy choice.

327
00:17:17,379 --> 00:17:21,784
She's only talked to Ye Chan and Seong Mo.

328
00:17:25,454 --> 00:17:29,325
(Lee Kang Hyeon chooses Moon Seong Mo.)

329
00:17:29,325 --> 00:17:33,128
Of the five men,

330
00:17:33,128 --> 00:17:34,997
Seong Mo is the only one...

331
00:17:35,464 --> 00:17:36,965
Kang Hyeon has had
that kind of chemistry with.

332
00:17:36,965 --> 00:17:38,067
Right.

333
00:17:39,401 --> 00:17:42,037
Do the women make this choice on the spot?

334
00:17:42,037 --> 00:17:43,105
Yeah.

335
00:17:44,039 --> 00:17:45,174
You're not upset about it, are you?

336
00:17:45,174 --> 00:17:46,342
- No.
- Really?

337
00:17:46,342 --> 00:17:48,310
- I'm grateful.
- Really? Are you sure?

338
00:17:49,745 --> 00:17:52,014
Yeah, because you didn't choose me. Right?

339
00:17:52,014 --> 00:17:53,248
Why would you say that?

340
00:17:55,384 --> 00:17:58,420
I appreciated it, but today was the day...

341
00:17:58,420 --> 00:18:02,891
I'd planned to tell Kang Hyeon...

342
00:18:04,159 --> 00:18:05,361
there was someone else I liked.

343
00:18:05,361 --> 00:18:06,729
- Really?
- I wanted to let her make her decision.

344
00:18:06,729 --> 00:18:07,763
So...

345
00:18:08,630 --> 00:18:10,332
I worried the date might be meaningless.

346
00:18:11,667 --> 00:18:14,136
I still haven't gotten
to talk to Jeong Yoon.

347
00:18:14,136 --> 00:18:15,804
Our timing has never worked out.

348
00:18:15,804 --> 00:18:17,139
Once Kang Hyeon stood beside me,

349
00:18:17,139 --> 00:18:19,608
I thought Jeong Yoon
couldn't stand there too.

350
00:18:19,608 --> 00:18:21,944
So I wondered, "What do I do?"

351
00:18:21,944 --> 00:18:23,112
Kang Hyeon.

352
00:18:28,684 --> 00:18:34,723
(Everyone but In Kwon has been chosen.)

353
00:18:35,024 --> 00:18:37,292
I didn't care if no one chose me.

354
00:18:37,292 --> 00:18:41,563
But I didn't want Jeong Yoon
to choose someone else.

355
00:18:41,563 --> 00:18:43,465
That was what bothered me most.

356
00:18:43,465 --> 00:18:44,600
And she was fifth.

357
00:18:45,467 --> 00:18:48,137
I actually liked going fifth.

358
00:18:48,737 --> 00:18:51,740
It meant I could watch everyone else
before choosing.

359
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,976
For once, I was happy with my number.

360
00:18:56,178 --> 00:18:57,913
She looked at it
in a completely different way.

361
00:18:57,913 --> 00:19:01,317
(Last is Choi Jeong Yoon.)

362
00:19:01,984 --> 00:19:04,820
One vague reason I thought...

363
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:06,989
Jeong Yoon might still come to me...

364
00:19:06,989 --> 00:19:11,627
was that when she was asked
for one trait in her ideal type,

365
00:19:11,627 --> 00:19:12,828
she said someone fair-skinned.

366
00:19:13,262 --> 00:19:14,997
Physical trait, fair skin.

367
00:19:15,130 --> 00:19:17,333
(Fair skin?)

368
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:19,868
So maybe I had a 50 percent chance.

369
00:19:19,868 --> 00:19:21,003
That gave me some hope.

370
00:19:21,937 --> 00:19:24,940
I'd wanted to go on a date
with Jeong Yoon soon.

371
00:19:24,940 --> 00:19:27,142
I hoped she'd come to me.

372
00:19:30,145 --> 00:19:31,213
Gosh.

373
00:19:31,213 --> 00:19:35,617
I was choosing
between the two men I had in mind.

374
00:19:35,617 --> 00:19:39,388
In Kwon expressed his feelings
with such certainty,

375
00:19:39,388 --> 00:19:41,523
and that made me like him more.

376
00:19:41,523 --> 00:19:45,728
Seong Mo turned out
to live just three minutes away.

377
00:19:45,728 --> 00:19:48,030
That was a big consideration for me too.

378
00:19:48,931 --> 00:19:52,735
(Who will Jeong Yoon choose?)

379
00:19:59,742 --> 00:20:00,743
Hi, Kang Hyeon.

380
00:20:02,044 --> 00:20:02,978
What?

381
00:20:07,716 --> 00:20:10,486
(Jeong Yoon stops beside Seong Mo.)

382
00:20:10,486 --> 00:20:11,420
What?

383
00:20:15,124 --> 00:20:16,058
Hi, Kang Hyeon.

384
00:20:17,860 --> 00:20:20,095
(She walks past
Kang Hyeon and Seong Mo.)

385
00:20:20,095 --> 00:20:21,930
I think that was a little signal.

386
00:20:21,930 --> 00:20:23,465
I think she'll go to In Kwon.

387
00:20:23,465 --> 00:20:29,405
(Where is Jeong Yoon headed?)

388
00:20:34,009 --> 00:20:34,943
Hello.

389
00:20:37,146 --> 00:20:38,681
Hello.

390
00:20:38,681 --> 00:20:39,782
Of course.

391
00:20:39,782 --> 00:20:43,986
(Choi Jeong Yoon chooses Lee In Kwon.)

392
00:20:43,986 --> 00:20:45,721
They look great together.

393
00:20:45,721 --> 00:20:46,889
They do.

394
00:20:48,490 --> 00:20:50,726
After waiting so long at the very end,

395
00:20:50,726 --> 00:20:53,329
Jeong Yoon finally came to me.

396
00:20:53,329 --> 00:20:57,299
I wondered whether sincerity...

397
00:20:57,866 --> 00:20:59,068
really does get through in the end.

398
00:20:59,501 --> 00:21:01,503
I'd talked to him more than anyone else,

399
00:21:01,503 --> 00:21:03,972
and I kept thinking about him,
so I chose him.

400
00:21:04,873 --> 00:21:06,375
I should at least put on a shirt.

401
00:21:06,875 --> 00:21:08,677
My mom probably won't care.

402
00:21:10,512 --> 00:21:12,014
Doesn't what I think matter too?

403
00:21:16,318 --> 00:21:18,153
They all matched up perfectly, one by one.

404
00:21:18,153 --> 00:21:19,088
(Meet-the-parents dates matched)

405
00:21:19,321 --> 00:21:21,457
It worked out. No one overlapped.

406
00:21:21,457 --> 00:21:23,659
Right. Perfect one-to-one matches.

407
00:21:24,326 --> 00:21:26,996
(Da Hye and Shin Woo
head to the restaurant.)

408
00:21:26,996 --> 00:21:31,367
Jeong Yoon is so feminine and beautiful.

409
00:21:31,367 --> 00:21:33,102
- That's how I feel about you.
- And Ha Yoon too.

410
00:21:33,369 --> 00:21:35,471
Looking at you, I thought,

411
00:21:35,471 --> 00:21:37,673
"How can anyone be this pretty?"

412
00:21:37,673 --> 00:21:39,775
(Squeezes her eyes shut)

413
00:21:39,775 --> 00:21:43,178
And every outfit gives you
a completely different vibe.

414
00:21:43,178 --> 00:21:44,179
Really?

415
00:21:44,179 --> 00:21:45,481
It makes me curious.

416
00:21:45,481 --> 00:21:46,715
About what?

417
00:21:46,715 --> 00:21:48,917
- Tomorrow.
- Tomorrow?

418
00:21:48,917 --> 00:21:51,153
What I'll wear tomorrow?

419
00:21:51,620 --> 00:21:56,358
I've gushed about you so much
in my interviews.

420
00:21:57,426 --> 00:21:58,861
I kept saying, "Isn't Da Hye so pretty?"

421
00:21:58,861 --> 00:22:00,663
- Really?
- Yeah.

422
00:22:00,663 --> 00:22:01,764
I'll have to be careful from now on.

423
00:22:12,574 --> 00:22:13,909
They're not here yet.

424
00:22:13,909 --> 00:22:16,478
(Do Yoon and Ye Chan arrive
at the restaurant.)

425
00:22:20,015 --> 00:22:22,117
You're not too nervous, are you?

426
00:22:22,117 --> 00:22:23,018
No.

427
00:22:23,585 --> 00:22:25,120
You don't look nervous at all.

428
00:22:25,721 --> 00:22:29,291
The mothers might've been
even more nervous than us.

429
00:22:31,794 --> 00:22:32,961
Here they come.

430
00:22:33,696 --> 00:22:35,364
Hello.

431
00:22:36,098 --> 00:22:37,499
(Ye Chan's mother arrives.)

432
00:22:37,499 --> 00:22:40,069
- Hello.
- Hello.

433
00:22:40,069 --> 00:22:41,937
Thank you.

434
00:22:43,906 --> 00:22:46,342
- I'm so nervous.
- You had no idea, did you?

435
00:22:46,342 --> 00:22:48,043
- None at all.
- Really?

436
00:22:48,043 --> 00:22:49,545
I had no idea.

437
00:22:49,812 --> 00:22:53,382
Even I'm a little nervous now.

438
00:22:53,382 --> 00:22:54,717
I'm so nervous.

439
00:22:54,717 --> 00:22:56,685
Thank you, Do Yoon.

440
00:22:56,685 --> 00:22:58,387
Didn't the women choose the date?

441
00:22:58,387 --> 00:23:00,322
Yes. I'm so grateful.

442
00:23:02,925 --> 00:23:05,561
You look even prettier today.

443
00:23:05,561 --> 00:23:09,231
- Your outfit today is...
- I hadn't gotten to talk to you, ma'am.

444
00:23:09,231 --> 00:23:10,566
This is fine for now, but...

445
00:23:11,066 --> 00:23:12,401
Do Yoon's mother will be here next.

446
00:23:12,401 --> 00:23:13,736
(Do Yoon's mother arrives next.)

447
00:23:13,736 --> 00:23:14,903
Wait, what?

448
00:23:17,439 --> 00:23:18,974
Hello.

449
00:23:20,275 --> 00:23:21,243
Who's that?

450
00:23:21,243 --> 00:23:23,946
(Someone else enters
with Do Yoon's mother.)

451
00:23:24,980 --> 00:23:26,515
Your younger sister?

452
00:23:26,515 --> 00:23:27,783
It is.

453
00:23:27,783 --> 00:23:29,752
- They look identical. Is that her sister?
- Is she her sister?

454
00:23:31,220 --> 00:23:32,855
(Do Yoon's look-alike
younger sister arrives.)

455
00:23:32,855 --> 00:23:34,490
Who's who? They look so alike.

456
00:23:35,591 --> 00:23:37,526
Your sister...

457
00:23:37,526 --> 00:23:38,827
Your sister came too.

458
00:23:39,194 --> 00:23:40,229
I had no idea either.

459
00:23:40,229 --> 00:23:41,430
Hello. It's nice to meet you.

460
00:23:41,430 --> 00:23:43,032
She's so pretty.

461
00:23:43,432 --> 00:23:44,466
Thank you.

462
00:23:44,466 --> 00:23:47,469
- Are you okay?
- Are you doing well?

463
00:23:47,469 --> 00:23:49,171
I was worried.

464
00:23:49,872 --> 00:23:52,408
I expected the mothers,

465
00:23:52,775 --> 00:23:54,877
but then my sister showed up.

466
00:23:54,877 --> 00:23:56,412
I had no idea she was coming.

467
00:23:56,412 --> 00:23:57,946
So I was completely shocked.

468
00:23:58,647 --> 00:24:00,349
Two people walked in.

469
00:24:00,349 --> 00:24:01,917
It was my first time
sitting down face-to-face...

470
00:24:01,917 --> 00:24:04,053
with a mother and her two daughters,

471
00:24:04,053 --> 00:24:06,221
so I had a lot going through my head.

472
00:24:06,955 --> 00:24:09,358
(Lee Kang Hyeon and Moon Seong Mo's room)

473
00:24:09,358 --> 00:24:10,993
Let's give them a warm welcome.

474
00:24:10,993 --> 00:24:11,827
Okay.

475
00:24:12,494 --> 00:24:14,096
I just hope the food comes soon.

476
00:24:14,596 --> 00:24:16,231
- That's a completely different topic.
- My goodness.

477
00:24:16,231 --> 00:24:18,100
She said,
"Let's give them a warm welcome,"

478
00:24:18,100 --> 00:24:20,102
and all he wants is for the food to come.

479
00:24:22,438 --> 00:24:24,540
I just hope the food comes soon.

480
00:24:24,540 --> 00:24:25,274
Are you that hungry?

481
00:24:25,274 --> 00:24:26,175
I'm starving.

482
00:24:33,515 --> 00:24:34,516
I can hear a father's voice.

483
00:24:34,516 --> 00:24:35,884
(Seong Mo's mother and father arrive.)

484
00:24:35,884 --> 00:24:37,286
His father came too?

485
00:24:37,286 --> 00:24:39,021
His father is here.

486
00:24:39,021 --> 00:24:40,656
- It's a real meeting of the families.
- It really is.

487
00:24:40,656 --> 00:24:41,924
This really is a meeting of the families.

488
00:24:43,158 --> 00:24:44,593
My goodness.

489
00:24:46,762 --> 00:24:47,763
Dad.

490
00:24:48,697 --> 00:24:51,333
(An unexpected father-son reunion)

491
00:24:51,834 --> 00:24:53,135
Hello.

492
00:24:53,135 --> 00:24:54,737
- This is Kang Hyeon.
- Hello.

493
00:24:54,737 --> 00:24:57,139
I'd have dressed more demurely
if I'd known. I can't believe this.

494
00:24:57,139 --> 00:24:58,273
You look beautiful.

495
00:24:58,273 --> 00:24:59,942
What do I do?

496
00:24:59,942 --> 00:25:01,477
I was so flustered.

497
00:25:01,477 --> 00:25:04,647
I never imagined his father would come.

498
00:25:04,647 --> 00:25:06,382
For a moment, I thought...

499
00:25:06,382 --> 00:25:09,184
"My dad isn't coming too, is he?"

500
00:25:09,718 --> 00:25:10,886
Say "surely not," and they always show up.

501
00:25:12,087 --> 00:25:13,255
That always happens.

502
00:25:17,092 --> 00:25:18,027
Goodness.

503
00:25:18,861 --> 00:25:20,763
Her father is there too.

504
00:25:20,763 --> 00:25:23,165
(Kang Hyeon's father
unexpectedly arrives too.)

505
00:25:24,266 --> 00:25:25,668
Hello.

506
00:25:26,635 --> 00:25:28,671
(Bursts into tears)

507
00:25:29,271 --> 00:25:30,539
You've worked hard, my girl.

508
00:25:32,174 --> 00:25:33,575
I knew she'd cry.

509
00:25:33,575 --> 00:25:34,576
(She bursts into tears
as soon as she sees him.)

510
00:25:34,576 --> 00:25:35,611
You've done well.

511
00:25:35,911 --> 00:25:37,179
I knew she'd cry.

512
00:25:37,179 --> 00:25:38,113
My goodness.

513
00:25:38,847 --> 00:25:39,915
Their baby girl.

514
00:25:39,915 --> 00:25:40,849
Hello.

515
00:25:42,618 --> 00:25:45,254
I thought work would keep you from coming.

516
00:25:45,254 --> 00:25:49,124
Why am I about to cry too?

517
00:25:50,192 --> 00:25:52,695
I knew from the start,
but it was a secret.

518
00:25:54,129 --> 00:25:55,264
Goodness.

519
00:25:56,365 --> 00:25:57,766
It's nice to meet you.

520
00:25:58,767 --> 00:26:00,269
(The fathers exchange
an awkward first greeting.)

521
00:26:00,269 --> 00:26:02,271
Hello. I'm Moon Seong Mo.

522
00:26:02,271 --> 00:26:05,441
This really is a formal family meeting.

523
00:26:07,042 --> 00:26:08,944
- This is great.
- I can't handle this.

524
00:26:09,611 --> 00:26:10,946
Please, sit down.

525
00:26:11,547 --> 00:26:14,116
First, I was shocked that my dad came.

526
00:26:14,116 --> 00:26:15,951
This whole mess had already unfolded.

527
00:26:15,951 --> 00:26:18,620
- He called it a mess.
- Kang Hyeon was someone...

528
00:26:18,620 --> 00:26:20,022
I no longer needed to see.

529
00:26:20,022 --> 00:26:21,757
"I no longer needed to see."

530
00:26:22,524 --> 00:26:24,626
What now?

531
00:26:25,127 --> 00:26:27,329
My parents don't know how I feel.

532
00:26:27,329 --> 00:26:30,332
But our parents were there
for a family date,

533
00:26:30,332 --> 00:26:31,834
so I didn't want to let it show.

534
00:26:32,434 --> 00:26:35,004
I thought,
"What do I do? This will be pointless."

535
00:26:35,537 --> 00:26:36,438
My goodness.

536
00:26:36,438 --> 00:26:38,607
Poor Kang Hyeon.

537
00:26:38,607 --> 00:26:39,642
Seriously.

538
00:26:39,642 --> 00:26:42,745
He was getting ready to tell Kang Hyeon,
"I like someone else,

539
00:26:42,745 --> 00:26:45,080
so please stop pursuing me."

540
00:26:45,080 --> 00:26:47,016
Then suddenly,

541
00:26:47,016 --> 00:26:49,485
even their fathers showed up,

542
00:26:49,485 --> 00:26:52,221
and it became a full meeting
of the two families.

543
00:26:52,221 --> 00:26:53,656
He must be completely flustered.

544
00:26:54,289 --> 00:26:56,525
He's having a family meeting...

545
00:26:56,525 --> 00:26:58,060
with someone he doesn't even like.

546
00:26:58,961 --> 00:27:01,597
- It's such an absurd situation.
- What now?

547
00:27:02,364 --> 00:27:03,632
- What do I do?
- Why?

548
00:27:04,566 --> 00:27:05,501
This is scary.

549
00:27:08,971 --> 00:27:10,305
(Startled)

550
00:27:11,106 --> 00:27:13,042
Everyone's coming.
They're all coming here too.

551
00:27:13,042 --> 00:27:14,877
(I'm here.)

552
00:27:14,877 --> 00:27:16,445
- Father.
- Hello.

553
00:27:17,146 --> 00:27:19,048
Hello. It's nice to meet you.

554
00:27:20,082 --> 00:27:22,217
(She looks ready to bow deeply.)

555
00:27:22,217 --> 00:27:23,152
You dressed up nicely.

556
00:27:23,152 --> 00:27:24,019
I heard there'd be food.

557
00:27:24,019 --> 00:27:25,788
He looks just like his father.

558
00:27:25,788 --> 00:27:29,258
Nice to meet you. I'm Kim Da Hye.

559
00:27:29,258 --> 00:27:30,092
I'm Shin Woo's father.

560
00:27:30,092 --> 00:27:32,594
Hello. It's nice to meet you.

561
00:27:32,594 --> 00:27:33,762
Thank you so much.

562
00:27:33,762 --> 00:27:34,997
Not at all.

563
00:27:34,997 --> 00:27:36,932
I'm crying because I'm so grateful.

564
00:27:36,932 --> 00:27:38,500
I'm the one who should be grateful.

565
00:27:38,500 --> 00:27:39,335
Please don't cry.

566
00:27:39,335 --> 00:27:41,003
Please sit here. How should we sit?

567
00:27:42,371 --> 00:27:44,606
Why are you crying, ma'am?

568
00:27:45,107 --> 00:27:47,276
Why are you crying, ma'am?

569
00:27:47,276 --> 00:27:49,445
Why is she suddenly crying?

570
00:27:49,445 --> 00:27:51,246
(Shin Woo's mother
suddenly bursts into tears.)

571
00:27:51,246 --> 00:27:52,848
She was afraid no one would choose you.

572
00:27:54,616 --> 00:27:56,118
You thought it'd be just the three of us?

573
00:27:56,118 --> 00:27:57,820
Then we'd just enjoy the food even more.

574
00:27:58,554 --> 00:28:00,522
It's okay. Please don't cry.

575
00:28:00,889 --> 00:28:03,125
His father had come such a long way,

576
00:28:03,125 --> 00:28:06,862
and if he had seen our son alone,

577
00:28:06,862 --> 00:28:09,631
I thought it would've broken his heart.

578
00:28:09,631 --> 00:28:11,266
- Yes.
- Right.

579
00:28:11,266 --> 00:28:13,435
- It would've been heartbreaking.
- She was worried about his dad.

580
00:28:13,435 --> 00:28:14,536
Exactly.

581
00:28:14,536 --> 00:28:17,606
She was just so grateful
to see him with someone.

582
00:28:17,606 --> 00:28:18,874
(Tears of relief
at seeing her son isn't alone)

583
00:28:18,874 --> 00:28:20,142
Isn't Da Hye beautiful?

584
00:28:20,142 --> 00:28:21,443
- She is.
- Thank you.

585
00:28:21,443 --> 00:28:22,945
You've never seen
such a beautiful woman, have you?

586
00:28:22,945 --> 00:28:23,712
Not at all.

587
00:28:27,349 --> 00:28:29,885
(Da Hye's mother arrives next.)

588
00:28:30,219 --> 00:28:31,220
(Springs to his feet)

589
00:28:31,220 --> 00:28:32,287
Hello, ma'am.

590
00:28:33,689 --> 00:28:34,823
Hello.

591
00:28:35,157 --> 00:28:36,258
His father is here too.

592
00:28:36,892 --> 00:28:37,726
What a surprise.

593
00:28:38,293 --> 00:28:39,928
Exactly.

594
00:28:39,928 --> 00:28:41,930
I cried.

595
00:28:41,930 --> 00:28:42,898
You did?

596
00:28:43,465 --> 00:28:44,466
My goodness.

597
00:28:44,466 --> 00:28:46,468
- Please sit there.
- Thank you.

598
00:28:46,468 --> 00:28:47,403
What a surprise.

599
00:28:48,771 --> 00:28:50,739
I was so shocked.

600
00:28:50,739 --> 00:28:54,310
I'd kept telling Da Hye
to talk to several men.

601
00:28:54,310 --> 00:28:55,744
So I was curious...

602
00:28:55,744 --> 00:28:58,647
to see whom she'd chosen.

603
00:28:58,647 --> 00:29:01,183
But when I opened the door,
the three of them were sitting there,

604
00:29:01,183 --> 00:29:02,951
and Shin Woo was the first person I saw.

605
00:29:02,951 --> 00:29:05,421
Since Da Hye had chosen him,

606
00:29:05,421 --> 00:29:08,924
I wondered if they'd talked a lot
while we were away.

607
00:29:09,158 --> 00:29:12,127
I wanted her to meet
and talk to more people,

608
00:29:12,127 --> 00:29:15,097
but now we're already
so far into the process.

609
00:29:16,565 --> 00:29:18,767
Her mother has a lot on her mind.

610
00:29:18,767 --> 00:29:20,169
She looks conflicted.

611
00:29:20,169 --> 00:29:22,104
Even Da Hye is watching
her mother's reaction.

612
00:29:23,439 --> 00:29:25,507
(Choi Jeong Yoon and Lee In Kwon's room)

613
00:29:25,507 --> 00:29:27,209
This is nerve-racking too.

614
00:29:27,209 --> 00:29:28,243
Really?

615
00:29:28,243 --> 00:29:30,279
I'm trying to think of what to say.

616
00:29:30,279 --> 00:29:32,014
That's what has me nervous.

617
00:29:33,582 --> 00:29:34,383
(Knock, knock)

618
00:29:34,383 --> 00:29:35,217
Yes?

619
00:29:36,118 --> 00:29:37,419
(In Kwon's mother arrives.)

620
00:29:37,419 --> 00:29:38,253
What?

621
00:29:39,922 --> 00:29:41,357
(Which family member
will it be this time?)

622
00:29:41,357 --> 00:29:43,125
- His father?
- It must be his father.

623
00:29:45,861 --> 00:29:47,596
- That's not his father.
- It's his older brother.

624
00:29:50,199 --> 00:29:51,734
He's my youngest brother.

625
00:29:53,135 --> 00:29:54,837
He's my youngest brother.

626
00:29:54,837 --> 00:29:56,205
I see.

627
00:29:56,205 --> 00:29:57,106
What do I do?

628
00:30:00,242 --> 00:30:02,544
Hello. It's nice to meet you.

629
00:30:04,613 --> 00:30:06,315
This really startled me.

630
00:30:06,315 --> 00:30:08,784
I never would've imagined this.

631
00:30:08,784 --> 00:30:11,153
No one knew. Everyone was shocked.

632
00:30:12,921 --> 00:30:15,591
- This is Choi Jeong Yoon.
- Hello.

633
00:30:15,591 --> 00:30:16,759
I forgot to introduce you.

634
00:30:17,493 --> 00:30:19,161
I'm Lee Yong Kwon.

635
00:30:19,161 --> 00:30:20,596
He seems dependable.

636
00:30:21,230 --> 00:30:22,998
No one expected this.

637
00:30:22,998 --> 00:30:25,100
(An awkward first meeting
with her future brother-in-law)

638
00:30:25,100 --> 00:30:26,969
Did you come to him fifth?

639
00:30:26,969 --> 00:30:28,704
I was last to choose,

640
00:30:28,704 --> 00:30:30,572
and when I got there, the spot was empty.

641
00:30:31,140 --> 00:30:32,441
Thank you.

642
00:30:33,375 --> 00:30:34,243
Not at all.

643
00:30:35,411 --> 00:30:36,612
(Knock, knock)

644
00:30:37,613 --> 00:30:39,348
(Jeong Yoon's mother arrives.)

645
00:30:39,348 --> 00:30:40,382
Did Dad come?

646
00:30:41,417 --> 00:30:42,851
- Hello.
- Hello.

647
00:30:42,851 --> 00:30:43,986
Her father.

648
00:30:45,487 --> 00:30:47,222
Jeong Yoon's father came too.

649
00:30:49,358 --> 00:30:51,160
(Bows 90 degrees)

650
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,594
How did you get here?

651
00:30:54,630 --> 00:30:56,131
He's his younger brother.

652
00:30:56,131 --> 00:30:58,233
- Hello.
- Hello.

653
00:30:59,234 --> 00:31:00,336
It's nice to meet you.

654
00:31:00,336 --> 00:31:02,404
Even you look surprised, Mom.
Dad didn't tell you?

655
00:31:05,374 --> 00:31:09,311
I've never met
a girlfriend's father in my life.

656
00:31:09,311 --> 00:31:10,980
And she's not even my girlfriend yet.

657
00:31:11,814 --> 00:31:13,682
We were only getting to know each other,

658
00:31:14,683 --> 00:31:16,518
so when her father walked in,

659
00:31:16,518 --> 00:31:20,122
it didn't feel right
to start chatting away,

660
00:31:20,122 --> 00:31:23,926
but sitting there looking all stern
felt wrong too.

661
00:31:23,926 --> 00:31:26,061
- It's hard.
- I was completely thrown.

662
00:31:27,029 --> 00:31:30,099
(Yang Ha Yoon and Kim Dong Young's room)

663
00:31:30,099 --> 00:31:32,201
I didn't think I'd be nervous, but I am.

664
00:31:32,201 --> 00:31:33,135
All of a sudden?

665
00:31:33,135 --> 00:31:35,170
Yeah. My mom...

666
00:31:35,170 --> 00:31:36,205
You're wondering how she'll react?

667
00:31:37,072 --> 00:31:38,707
I've done everything I can.

668
00:31:40,109 --> 00:31:42,011
But I doubt this will settle everything.

669
00:31:47,983 --> 00:31:50,285
There's the distance issue,

670
00:31:50,285 --> 00:31:54,690
and I think I've chosen someone...

671
00:31:54,690 --> 00:31:56,558
other than the man my mom prefers.

672
00:31:58,227 --> 00:32:00,329
I worried about how Mom would handle it.

673
00:32:01,163 --> 00:32:02,698
That worried me.

674
00:32:03,766 --> 00:32:07,803
She'd kept choosing the lawyer.

675
00:32:07,803 --> 00:32:08,737
Her mother did.

676
00:32:09,872 --> 00:32:10,706
(Knock, knock)

677
00:32:10,706 --> 00:32:11,507
Yes?

678
00:32:14,443 --> 00:32:15,778
(Laughing)

679
00:32:15,778 --> 00:32:16,879
What?

680
00:32:16,879 --> 00:32:17,780
What?

681
00:32:19,014 --> 00:32:20,215
(Another family member enters
with Dong Young's mother.)

682
00:32:20,215 --> 00:32:20,883
My goodness.

683
00:32:20,883 --> 00:32:22,851
Thank you, Ha Yoon.

684
00:32:22,851 --> 00:32:24,320
Hello.

685
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:26,655
I'm Dong Young's older brother,
Kim Dong Jin.

686
00:32:26,655 --> 00:32:29,625
- Hello. Goodness.
- His older brother came.

687
00:32:29,625 --> 00:32:31,360
Even I was surprised.

688
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:32,961
(Flustered by
his brother's unexpected arrival)

689
00:32:32,961 --> 00:32:34,229
He's really surprised.

690
00:32:34,930 --> 00:32:37,399
I can't put into words...

691
00:32:37,399 --> 00:32:39,001
how grateful I was.

692
00:32:39,001 --> 00:32:41,670
I peeked through the crack
and saw Ha Yoon.

693
00:32:41,670 --> 00:32:43,005
A wave of joy washed over me.

694
00:32:43,005 --> 00:32:44,073
Yeah.

695
00:32:44,073 --> 00:32:46,976
I wondered if my son...

696
00:32:46,976 --> 00:32:49,078
had worked incredibly hard
while I was away.

697
00:32:49,078 --> 00:32:49,778
That's right.

698
00:32:49,778 --> 00:32:52,448
I was just so grateful she'd come.

699
00:32:53,749 --> 00:32:55,217
Goodness.

700
00:32:55,217 --> 00:32:56,986
(Endless gratitude)

701
00:32:56,986 --> 00:32:58,053
Thank you so much.

702
00:32:59,288 --> 00:33:02,725
His brother kept encouraging
Dong Young to apply.

703
00:33:02,725 --> 00:33:03,759
I see.

704
00:33:03,759 --> 00:33:05,928
I should buy you a meal.

705
00:33:06,595 --> 00:33:08,297
I never dreamed I'd get to meet Ha Yoon.

706
00:33:10,132 --> 00:33:11,633
She hasn't made her final choice yet.

707
00:33:11,633 --> 00:33:13,068
Right. This isn't the final choice.

708
00:33:13,068 --> 00:33:15,004
- You keep getting ahead of yourself.
- I shouldn't get cocky.

709
00:33:15,637 --> 00:33:17,539
Where do you live, by the way?

710
00:33:17,539 --> 00:33:19,575
I live in Seoul.

711
00:33:19,575 --> 00:33:23,178
Then you two are a little far apart.

712
00:33:23,178 --> 00:33:24,179
That's right.

713
00:33:24,179 --> 00:33:25,247
So it would be long-distance.

714
00:33:25,247 --> 00:33:26,582
Yes.

715
00:33:26,582 --> 00:33:28,384
That's the biggest concern.

716
00:33:32,788 --> 00:33:34,189
Mom.

717
00:33:34,523 --> 00:33:37,192
Hello, ma'am. You're here.

718
00:33:37,826 --> 00:33:40,562
(Ha Yoon's mother arrives next.)

719
00:33:40,562 --> 00:33:43,298
Her expression...

720
00:33:43,298 --> 00:33:44,600
Mom, did you come alone?

721
00:33:45,100 --> 00:33:47,970
- She doesn't look...
- Her expression...

722
00:33:47,970 --> 00:33:49,505
happy.

723
00:33:50,039 --> 00:33:52,574
Hello, ma'am. You're here.

724
00:33:53,309 --> 00:33:54,576
You're surprised.

725
00:33:56,011 --> 00:33:57,346
Mom, did you come alone?

726
00:33:59,481 --> 00:34:00,749
Mom, did you come alone?

727
00:34:02,084 --> 00:34:03,419
You were surprised, weren't you?

728
00:34:05,654 --> 00:34:07,723
(Awkward laughter)

729
00:34:07,956 --> 00:34:09,258
Say hello. Come on.

730
00:34:09,258 --> 00:34:10,526
Hello.

731
00:34:11,093 --> 00:34:14,330
I'm Dong Young's older brother,
Kim Dong Jin.

732
00:34:14,330 --> 00:34:16,298
I see. Hello.

733
00:34:16,298 --> 00:34:17,266
Hello.

734
00:34:17,266 --> 00:34:18,434
Please, sit down.

735
00:34:20,336 --> 00:34:21,570
I was shocked.

736
00:34:23,772 --> 00:34:25,674
Dong Young was sitting there.

737
00:34:25,674 --> 00:34:28,110
I realized a lot must have happened,

738
00:34:28,110 --> 00:34:32,648
and that she'd chosen Dong Young again.

739
00:34:33,082 --> 00:34:34,283
Well...

740
00:34:35,818 --> 00:34:36,952
Well...

741
00:34:38,087 --> 00:34:39,188
This is hard.

742
00:34:41,023 --> 00:34:42,658
Her mother...

743
00:34:42,658 --> 00:34:46,762
already thought the distance
and other factors were difficult.

744
00:34:46,762 --> 00:34:49,832
Then she saw
Dong Young's family sitting there.

745
00:34:49,832 --> 00:34:51,100
And she was at a loss for words.

746
00:34:51,100 --> 00:34:54,203
Her face gave her away
before she could hide it.

747
00:34:54,203 --> 00:34:55,237
Right.

748
00:34:56,772 --> 00:35:00,042
We're very grateful Ha Yoon chose him.

749
00:35:00,042 --> 00:35:01,877
Yes.

750
00:35:01,877 --> 00:35:04,146
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

751
00:35:05,180 --> 00:35:06,315
So...

752
00:35:06,315 --> 00:35:10,953
when you two talked,
was Dong Young one of her options?

753
00:35:10,953 --> 00:35:12,054
- Of course.
- Of course.

754
00:35:12,054 --> 00:35:14,590
Both my mom and I chose him
on first impression.

755
00:35:14,590 --> 00:35:15,591
But he didn't choose me.

756
00:35:17,126 --> 00:35:18,093
Get out.

757
00:35:19,028 --> 00:35:21,430
- She zero votes.
- Zero votes.

758
00:35:21,430 --> 00:35:22,364
Really?

759
00:35:23,298 --> 00:35:24,800
What on earth...

760
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:25,968
were you doing?

761
00:35:26,502 --> 00:35:27,469
"What were you doing?"

762
00:35:28,137 --> 00:35:31,273
At least it was only the first day.

763
00:35:31,273 --> 00:35:34,877
Zero votes midway through
would've been worse.

764
00:35:34,877 --> 00:35:36,211
Yes.

765
00:35:36,211 --> 00:35:38,013
- Shall we eat?
- Please, go ahead.

766
00:35:38,914 --> 00:35:40,516
I'd like to serve you some food, ma'am.

767
00:35:40,516 --> 00:35:42,384
No.

768
00:35:42,384 --> 00:35:43,452
(She adamantly declines.)

769
00:35:43,452 --> 00:35:45,321
Let's all just help ourselves.

770
00:35:46,322 --> 00:35:48,590
- This is uncomfortable.
- My goodness.

771
00:35:49,458 --> 00:35:53,529
Dong Young made a good
first impression on me too,

772
00:35:53,529 --> 00:35:55,631
but I couldn't take
my eyes off you, ma'am.

773
00:35:55,631 --> 00:35:56,598
Honestly.

774
00:35:56,598 --> 00:35:58,634
So I chose him because of you.

775
00:36:00,269 --> 00:36:01,603
- Be good to your mother.
- Dong Young.

776
00:36:04,740 --> 00:36:06,442
See how sweetly she talks?

777
00:36:07,643 --> 00:36:09,244
I hope this is her final choice.

778
00:36:12,081 --> 00:36:14,316
Mom, please.

779
00:36:17,186 --> 00:36:18,654
Look at her.

780
00:36:18,654 --> 00:36:20,022
She's keeping her face under control.

781
00:36:20,022 --> 00:36:21,256
This is too...

782
00:36:21,757 --> 00:36:23,859
I'm so uncomfortable right now.

783
00:36:29,398 --> 00:36:33,369
Since Ha Yoon lives in Seoul,

784
00:36:33,369 --> 00:36:36,972
you must be worried about the distance.

785
00:36:36,972 --> 00:36:38,040
Very much.

786
00:36:38,040 --> 00:36:39,141
- Right?
- Yes.

787
00:36:39,141 --> 00:36:43,512
She may look strong,

788
00:36:43,512 --> 00:36:46,415
but she rarely lets on
when she's struggling.

789
00:36:46,415 --> 00:36:50,019
Would you be okay sending her far away?

790
00:36:50,019 --> 00:36:51,487
I'm not sending her far away.

791
00:36:52,054 --> 00:36:53,355
I'm not sending her far away.

792
00:36:55,057 --> 00:36:56,225
I said I'd move.

793
00:36:57,092 --> 00:36:58,160
This is...

794
00:36:58,160 --> 00:36:59,495
It's like walking on thin ice.

795
00:36:59,495 --> 00:37:00,863
Things are really tense.

796
00:37:00,863 --> 00:37:03,832
Ha Yoon's mother is already...

797
00:37:03,832 --> 00:37:09,505
holding herself back
with every ounce of patience.

798
00:37:09,505 --> 00:37:12,508
He meant it as an icebreaker, but she...

799
00:37:12,508 --> 00:37:15,778
She just said exactly how she felt.

800
00:37:15,778 --> 00:37:17,112
I'm not sending her far away.

801
00:37:18,747 --> 00:37:19,948
I said I'd move.

802
00:37:20,816 --> 00:37:22,251
This isn't the final choice.

803
00:37:22,251 --> 00:37:24,720
I don't mean
she's necessarily going that far.

804
00:37:24,720 --> 00:37:27,356
He means thinking of
a woman being sent off in marriage.

805
00:37:27,990 --> 00:37:31,560
I see it as welcoming
a new member to the family.

806
00:37:32,361 --> 00:37:35,230
We'd be bringing home a well-raised son.

807
00:37:37,266 --> 00:37:38,400
I like that way of looking at it.

808
00:37:39,201 --> 00:37:40,836
Exactly.

809
00:37:40,836 --> 00:37:43,238
Both sides...

810
00:37:44,006 --> 00:37:46,041
I have no intention
of sending her far away.

811
00:37:47,710 --> 00:37:49,478
Even if...

812
00:37:49,478 --> 00:37:52,648
Even if they ended up dating,

813
00:37:54,149 --> 00:37:55,517
wouldn't he need to move here?

814
00:37:56,652 --> 00:37:59,888
I remember thinking,

815
00:37:59,888 --> 00:38:02,691
"They've got it all wrong."

816
00:38:04,126 --> 00:38:06,195
I'm not sure.

817
00:38:06,195 --> 00:38:09,231
I don't know what she's really thinking.

818
00:38:09,231 --> 00:38:10,933
When Ha Yoon's mother...

819
00:38:10,933 --> 00:38:13,335
first opened the door and came in,

820
00:38:14,303 --> 00:38:17,539
she didn't exactly look pleased.

821
00:38:17,539 --> 00:38:19,541
Honestly, my heart...

822
00:38:19,541 --> 00:38:22,378
sank a little.

823
00:38:22,378 --> 00:38:25,547
I don't think
she needs to feel pressured at all,

824
00:38:25,547 --> 00:38:27,816
but her mother may see it differently.

825
00:38:27,816 --> 00:38:29,885
That does worry me.

826
00:38:30,753 --> 00:38:35,824
If they were already
deeply in love and committed,

827
00:38:35,824 --> 00:38:37,993
then whether it was long-distance
or anything else,

828
00:38:37,993 --> 00:38:42,798
she might say,
"What can I do if you love each other?"

829
00:38:42,798 --> 00:38:44,099
But right now...

830
00:38:44,099 --> 00:38:45,034
They're only just starting out.

831
00:38:45,034 --> 00:38:46,669
So as her mother,

832
00:38:46,669 --> 00:38:49,738
she can't help thinking...

833
00:38:49,738 --> 00:38:51,640
she should step in and stop it now.

834
00:38:51,640 --> 00:38:55,811
His mother and brother were so overjoyed,

835
00:38:55,811 --> 00:38:57,813
as if they were at a celebration.

836
00:38:57,813 --> 00:39:00,416
I think Ha Yoon's mother...

837
00:39:00,416 --> 00:39:03,919
actually felt put off by it.

838
00:39:05,054 --> 00:39:07,189
(Ahn Do Yoon and Kwon Ye Chan's room)

839
00:39:07,189 --> 00:39:09,024
I never saw this coming.

840
00:39:09,024 --> 00:39:11,260
I don't have a daughter,

841
00:39:11,260 --> 00:39:13,462
so I absolutely adore daughters.

842
00:39:13,462 --> 00:39:15,497
And I don't have a son.

843
00:39:15,497 --> 00:39:18,500
- So he's so handsome.
- Really?

844
00:39:19,034 --> 00:39:20,235
The moment I saw him,

845
00:39:20,235 --> 00:39:22,805
I thought he was exactly my sister's type.

846
00:39:23,672 --> 00:39:25,941
The younger sister.

847
00:39:25,941 --> 00:39:27,142
Ask him anything you want.

848
00:39:27,910 --> 00:39:30,379
Feel free to ask me anything.

849
00:39:30,379 --> 00:39:32,214
I haven't been told anything.

850
00:39:32,214 --> 00:39:34,550
I'm Kwon Ye Chan.

851
00:39:34,550 --> 00:39:37,052
I was born in 1993,

852
00:39:37,052 --> 00:39:39,355
and I've been practicing law
for three years.

853
00:39:40,823 --> 00:39:42,257
(Two thumbs up)

854
00:39:43,459 --> 00:39:45,661
How do you feel now that you know?

855
00:39:45,661 --> 00:39:46,662
I'm so...

856
00:39:47,363 --> 00:39:48,597
grateful.

857
00:39:49,164 --> 00:39:50,933
I'm the one who's grateful.

858
00:39:50,933 --> 00:39:52,634
My sister is a wonderful person.

859
00:39:53,168 --> 00:39:54,236
Thank you.

860
00:39:54,236 --> 00:39:55,637
I'd say so too.

861
00:39:57,206 --> 00:39:58,741
Please take good care of her.

862
00:39:58,741 --> 00:40:00,242
- Please enjoy the food, ma'am.
- Let's eat.

863
00:40:00,442 --> 00:40:02,578
(They finally begin eating.)

864
00:40:02,578 --> 00:40:03,746
This is fun.

865
00:40:03,746 --> 00:40:05,247
- You can't reach.
- Thanks.

866
00:40:06,148 --> 00:40:07,983
(Glances over)

867
00:40:07,983 --> 00:40:09,051
I'll take some.

868
00:40:09,051 --> 00:40:12,221
(Ye Chan looks after Do Yoon.)

869
00:40:13,355 --> 00:40:14,490
Let me put some of this on your plate.

870
00:40:15,758 --> 00:40:17,926
(Her eyes keep drifting over.)

871
00:40:19,728 --> 00:40:20,996
You have pollen on you.

872
00:40:21,864 --> 00:40:22,931
You have pollen on you.

873
00:40:23,399 --> 00:40:26,168
(Front-row seats to her sister's romance)

874
00:40:30,272 --> 00:40:33,842
Even their families...

875
00:40:33,842 --> 00:40:37,279
seem like they'd get along well too.

876
00:40:37,279 --> 00:40:38,514
I think so.

877
00:40:39,348 --> 00:40:42,117
Thank you for coming all this way.

878
00:40:42,851 --> 00:40:44,119
Introduce yourself.

879
00:40:44,119 --> 00:40:47,189
I'm 35, born in 1992.

880
00:40:47,189 --> 00:40:51,727
I'm a professional golfer.

881
00:40:53,696 --> 00:40:57,700
We're very similar in temperament.

882
00:40:57,700 --> 00:40:59,335
- In temperament?
- We're a lot alike.

883
00:40:59,335 --> 00:41:01,303
He's just like me.

884
00:41:02,304 --> 00:41:04,406
Just as I bought you a car, Dad,

885
00:41:04,406 --> 00:41:06,008
he bought his mother a car.

886
00:41:06,008 --> 00:41:08,077
That turned out to be something
you two had in common.

887
00:41:08,077 --> 00:41:11,447
He doesn't spend lavishly on himself.

888
00:41:11,447 --> 00:41:13,549
Even if...

889
00:41:13,549 --> 00:41:14,817
he has to drive a less comfortable car,

890
00:41:14,817 --> 00:41:16,819
he puts his parents first.

891
00:41:16,819 --> 00:41:18,487
He's also very softhearted and kind.

892
00:41:19,722 --> 00:41:23,325
I wasn't interested in Kang Hyeon anymore,

893
00:41:23,325 --> 00:41:25,561
so whatever she did,

894
00:41:25,561 --> 00:41:27,429
I didn't feel much of anything.

895
00:41:27,763 --> 00:41:29,531
Goodness.

896
00:41:30,265 --> 00:41:31,533
Goodness.

897
00:41:32,334 --> 00:41:34,703
(While Seong Mo
isn't thinking much at all,)

898
00:41:34,703 --> 00:41:36,972
(he gets down to eating.)

899
00:41:37,539 --> 00:41:39,108
(He eats...)

900
00:41:39,108 --> 00:41:40,843
(and eats some more.)

901
00:41:41,543 --> 00:41:42,544
Aren't you eating that?

902
00:41:43,912 --> 00:41:45,814
You can take it.
I've had one bite, for the record.

903
00:41:49,418 --> 00:41:52,621
(Picks up the whole fish)

904
00:41:52,888 --> 00:41:54,156
How can he eat so well like that?

905
00:41:54,156 --> 00:41:55,924
This is practically...

906
00:41:58,560 --> 00:42:00,462
You really can eat.

907
00:42:00,462 --> 00:42:01,764
You really can.

908
00:42:01,764 --> 00:42:03,098
(The most delicious meet-the-parents meal)

909
00:42:03,098 --> 00:42:04,066
Unbelievably.

910
00:42:06,035 --> 00:42:08,504
I arrived knowing nothing about you.

911
00:42:08,504 --> 00:42:10,439
I'm 37 years old,

912
00:42:10,439 --> 00:42:13,242
and I work as an announcer at SBS.

913
00:42:13,242 --> 00:42:14,176
I see.

914
00:42:14,543 --> 00:42:15,778
On the way here,

915
00:42:16,779 --> 00:42:19,114
I asked what kind of person
her father was.

916
00:42:19,448 --> 00:42:21,850
She said you adore your daughter.

917
00:42:22,651 --> 00:42:24,286
What is your father like?

918
00:42:24,286 --> 00:42:25,321
- My dad?
- Yes.

919
00:42:25,321 --> 00:42:26,989
He's even gentler than Mom.

920
00:42:26,989 --> 00:42:28,557
My dad absolutely dotes on me.

921
00:42:28,557 --> 00:42:31,460
He drove me to school every day...

922
00:42:31,460 --> 00:42:33,962
so I could sleep ten minutes longer.

923
00:42:33,962 --> 00:42:35,164
- Really?
- Yes, by car.

924
00:42:35,698 --> 00:42:37,299
I can't possibly compete with her.

925
00:42:38,233 --> 00:42:39,868
There's no way I can win.

926
00:42:41,236 --> 00:42:43,272
An unwilling doting dad?

927
00:42:43,806 --> 00:42:45,074
I'm scared.

928
00:42:46,008 --> 00:42:48,043
You'd better treat my daughter well.

929
00:42:48,043 --> 00:42:49,645
And she should treat you well too.

930
00:42:51,747 --> 00:42:53,482
Ask him anything you want.

931
00:42:53,482 --> 00:42:54,783
Please feel free.

932
00:42:55,417 --> 00:42:56,852
Do you drink?

933
00:42:57,486 --> 00:42:58,721
I don't particularly like alcohol,

934
00:42:58,721 --> 00:43:01,991
but I enjoy it
when the occasion calls for it.

935
00:43:01,991 --> 00:43:03,826
What do you usually do in your free time?

936
00:43:03,826 --> 00:43:05,227
Any sports you enjoy?

937
00:43:05,227 --> 00:43:08,697
Working out is my favorite.

938
00:43:08,998 --> 00:43:11,867
Where do you see yourself in ten years?

939
00:43:13,869 --> 00:43:16,405
He really is a doting dad.

940
00:43:16,405 --> 00:43:17,873
(Thinks deeply)

941
00:43:17,873 --> 00:43:20,042
Don't you imagine
what your life will look like?

942
00:43:20,676 --> 00:43:23,512
(An in-depth interview
for the future son-in-law)

943
00:43:23,512 --> 00:43:26,815
I see my thirties
as laying the groundwork for my forties.

944
00:43:26,815 --> 00:43:27,583
Right.

945
00:43:27,583 --> 00:43:29,485
I've thought that way
since my mid-thirties.

946
00:43:29,485 --> 00:43:31,120
When I'm 47,

947
00:43:32,321 --> 00:43:36,325
I expect my life to be
much more stable than it is now,

948
00:43:36,325 --> 00:43:40,162
with many more options available to me.

949
00:43:40,162 --> 00:43:41,263
That's what I wanted to hear.

950
00:43:42,264 --> 00:43:43,699
You've got a good head on your shoulders.

951
00:43:43,699 --> 00:43:45,367
(He passes the in-depth interview.)

952
00:43:45,367 --> 00:43:49,738
He checks every box
as a potential son-in-law.

953
00:43:49,738 --> 00:43:50,706
Exactly.

954
00:43:50,706 --> 00:43:53,242
With his looks and his career,

955
00:43:53,242 --> 00:43:57,379
he must seem to have it all.

956
00:43:57,846 --> 00:44:00,616
I envy you
for having a beautiful daughter.

957
00:44:02,818 --> 00:44:04,420
Our family...

958
00:44:04,420 --> 00:44:06,989
Even our dogs are male.

959
00:44:07,489 --> 00:44:08,390
Five sons.

960
00:44:08,390 --> 00:44:11,160
What do you like about having a dog?

961
00:44:11,160 --> 00:44:15,030
They bring ten times more joy
than trouble.

962
00:44:15,030 --> 00:44:16,732
- I see.
- They're so lovable.

963
00:44:16,732 --> 00:44:19,068
But when it comes to dogs...

964
00:44:19,068 --> 00:44:21,003
Da Hye's mother wasn't keen
on the idea, right?

965
00:44:21,003 --> 00:44:22,404
She's sensitive to that issue.

966
00:44:22,905 --> 00:44:24,773
What worries me is...

967
00:44:24,773 --> 00:44:27,142
one of our son's flaws...

968
00:44:27,142 --> 00:44:29,745
is that he puts his dog first.

969
00:44:29,745 --> 00:44:30,646
She's mentioning that there?

970
00:44:30,646 --> 00:44:34,483
There may be times
when you can't understand him.

971
00:44:34,483 --> 00:44:35,818
- I can see that.
- Of course.

972
00:44:35,818 --> 00:44:37,219
Because his dog is a large breed.

973
00:44:37,219 --> 00:44:38,387
Right.

974
00:44:38,387 --> 00:44:39,555
He eats a lot...

975
00:44:39,555 --> 00:44:41,390
and poops a lot.

976
00:44:41,623 --> 00:44:42,758
My goodness.

977
00:44:42,758 --> 00:44:44,193
I do worry...

978
00:44:44,193 --> 00:44:46,295
that could cause conflict.

979
00:44:46,295 --> 00:44:48,030
This conversation...

980
00:44:48,030 --> 00:44:49,832
What she's saying now...

981
00:44:49,832 --> 00:44:53,235
isn't helping Shin Woo at all.

982
00:44:53,235 --> 00:44:55,471
She could've mentioned that later.

983
00:44:55,471 --> 00:44:56,805
Right.

984
00:44:57,606 --> 00:44:59,575
Your mother and I talked about this too,

985
00:44:59,575 --> 00:45:02,611
and we both said
you two should meet everyone.

986
00:45:02,611 --> 00:45:06,448
There aren't many people here,
and it'd help you get to know everyone.

987
00:45:06,448 --> 00:45:09,118
It would make the final choice easier too.

988
00:45:09,118 --> 00:45:10,886
That's what we talked about.

989
00:45:10,886 --> 00:45:12,154
(Both mothers encouraged them
to meet different people.)

990
00:45:12,154 --> 00:45:13,989
I did my best to let go
of my stubbornness...

991
00:45:13,989 --> 00:45:15,424
and talk to almost all of them.

992
00:45:15,424 --> 00:45:16,325
You did?

993
00:45:16,859 --> 00:45:19,128
But the more I talked to the others,

994
00:45:19,128 --> 00:45:20,796
the more I thought about Da Hye.

995
00:45:20,796 --> 00:45:21,864
This is driving me crazy.

996
00:45:22,798 --> 00:45:23,899
My goodness.

997
00:45:24,233 --> 00:45:26,769
I couldn't focus
because she kept coming to mind.

998
00:45:26,769 --> 00:45:29,538
Da Hye was all you could think about.

999
00:45:29,538 --> 00:45:30,973
I did try.

1000
00:45:30,973 --> 00:45:32,474
You really do go all in.

1001
00:45:34,176 --> 00:45:37,079
I came here genuinely hoping
to find my person,

1002
00:45:38,847 --> 00:45:40,616
and I think I've found her.

1003
00:45:44,053 --> 00:45:45,554
- Goodness.
- Thank you.

1004
00:45:49,725 --> 00:45:53,095
I've practiced Korean medicine
for eight years.

1005
00:45:53,095 --> 00:45:55,664
I'm confident in my abilities,

1006
00:45:55,664 --> 00:45:57,066
so I know I'll do well.

1007
00:45:57,933 --> 00:46:00,836
And I'll support Da Hye as much as I can.

1008
00:46:01,837 --> 00:46:02,971
Thank you.

1009
00:46:06,175 --> 00:46:07,476
It feels like
we're about to set a wedding date.

1010
00:46:09,578 --> 00:46:11,914
He'll be incredibly busy
for the next five years.

1011
00:46:13,749 --> 00:46:16,685
- She doesn't look...
- Her expression...

1012
00:46:16,685 --> 00:46:18,187
happy.

1013
00:46:18,921 --> 00:46:20,489
What's the age difference
between you and your brother?

1014
00:46:20,489 --> 00:46:22,124
- He's three years older.
- Three years.

1015
00:46:22,124 --> 00:46:23,025
He isn't married yet, is he?

1016
00:46:23,025 --> 00:46:24,360
My brother isn't married yet.

1017
00:46:24,360 --> 00:46:26,929
I don't think marriage is on his mind yet.

1018
00:46:26,929 --> 00:46:29,598
My parents probably won't mind
if we marry first.

1019
00:46:29,598 --> 00:46:31,834
Not at all.

1020
00:46:31,834 --> 00:46:32,968
Not at all. Right, Dad?

1021
00:46:32,968 --> 00:46:34,169
This is getting out of hand.

1022
00:46:34,169 --> 00:46:34,970
We're totally open to it.

1023
00:46:34,970 --> 00:46:37,606
Please don't get ahead of yourself.

1024
00:46:37,606 --> 00:46:39,108
What do we do about him?

1025
00:46:39,108 --> 00:46:41,777
- This is overwhelming.
- I'm so uncomfortable.

1026
00:46:45,280 --> 00:46:49,284
It made me feel even more pressured,

1027
00:46:49,284 --> 00:46:52,855
and made me feel
he wasn't being very considerate...

1028
00:46:52,855 --> 00:46:54,623
in that moment.

1029
00:46:55,224 --> 00:46:58,193
It left me even more conflicted.

1030
00:46:58,794 --> 00:47:00,195
Already?

1031
00:47:01,296 --> 00:47:02,898
He came on so strong, so fast.

1032
00:47:02,898 --> 00:47:06,301
It was overwhelming. It really was.

1033
00:47:06,301 --> 00:47:09,471
Marriage after knowing each other
only a few days?

1034
00:47:09,471 --> 00:47:10,973
That still felt...

1035
00:47:10,973 --> 00:47:13,942
far too soon to think that way.

1036
00:47:13,942 --> 00:47:16,478
I think he mistook that
for a real family meeting.

1037
00:47:16,478 --> 00:47:17,813
I think so.

1038
00:47:17,813 --> 00:47:20,249
Da Hye seemed very uncomfortable.

1039
00:47:20,249 --> 00:47:22,484
Both his parents were there.

1040
00:47:22,484 --> 00:47:25,587
Until then,
he'd been holding himself back...

1041
00:47:25,587 --> 00:47:27,656
and trying not to let his feelings show.

1042
00:47:27,656 --> 00:47:29,992
But the women were choosing,

1043
00:47:29,992 --> 00:47:30,926
and she came to him...

1044
00:47:30,926 --> 00:47:32,227
for the meet-the-parents date.

1045
00:47:32,227 --> 00:47:34,263
So all his restraint went out the window,

1046
00:47:34,263 --> 00:47:36,865
and every happy thought came pouring out.

1047
00:47:36,865 --> 00:47:38,834
With his parents there too...

1048
00:47:38,834 --> 00:47:39,635
He got carried away.

1049
00:47:39,635 --> 00:47:41,437
Everything came pouring out
in his excitement.

1050
00:47:42,871 --> 00:47:46,542
(Jeong Yoon's father waits
for someone after the meal.)

1051
00:47:47,443 --> 00:47:48,344
No way.

1052
00:47:49,378 --> 00:47:51,013
- Come on.
- Really?

1053
00:47:51,013 --> 00:47:52,014
No way.

1054
00:47:52,014 --> 00:47:53,349
(Lee In Kwon appears.)

1055
00:47:53,349 --> 00:47:54,249
If this happens...

1056
00:47:54,249 --> 00:47:56,485
- This must be terrifying.
- Alone with her father?

1057
00:47:56,485 --> 00:47:58,420
For the men...

1058
00:47:58,420 --> 00:48:00,789
It must be incredibly hard, right?

1059
00:48:00,789 --> 00:48:03,058
- It could be terrifying.
- Exactly.

1060
00:48:03,058 --> 00:48:04,860
One-on-one time with a father
who dotes on his daughter.

1061
00:48:05,227 --> 00:48:07,563
What a golden opportunity.

1062
00:48:07,563 --> 00:48:08,931
(Jeong Yoon's father
and In Kwon sit alone.)

1063
00:48:08,931 --> 00:48:13,902
Please ask me anything you'd like.

1064
00:48:13,902 --> 00:48:16,839
I'll answer everything honestly.

1065
00:48:19,375 --> 00:48:22,411
You do plan to get married, right?
You're not opposed to marriage?

1066
00:48:22,811 --> 00:48:25,714
(A blunt question right from the start)

1067
00:48:25,714 --> 00:48:26,615
Not at all.

1068
00:48:26,615 --> 00:48:27,616
You do want to get married?

1069
00:48:27,616 --> 00:48:28,951
I want to get married,

1070
00:48:28,951 --> 00:48:31,353
which is why I joined this show.

1071
00:48:33,088 --> 00:48:35,524
How many children would you like to have?

1072
00:48:36,859 --> 00:48:37,726
Well...

1073
00:48:37,726 --> 00:48:38,827
You're not planning to be DINKs, are you?

1074
00:48:38,827 --> 00:48:40,462
No.

1075
00:48:40,829 --> 00:48:42,798
If I have kids,

1076
00:48:42,798 --> 00:48:44,033
rather than stopping at one,

1077
00:48:45,134 --> 00:48:49,805
I think I should give them a sibling
to go through life with.

1078
00:48:50,272 --> 00:48:51,974
It feels like a job interview.

1079
00:48:52,675 --> 00:48:56,045
May I ask what attracted you
to Jeong Yoon?

1080
00:48:56,045 --> 00:48:57,513
That's one of the hardest questions.

1081
00:48:57,513 --> 00:48:58,747
But of course you can ask.

1082
00:48:59,915 --> 00:49:01,650
Honestly, I was drawn to her
because she's beautiful.

1083
00:49:01,650 --> 00:49:02,618
Good.

1084
00:49:02,618 --> 00:49:03,752
That was a good answer.

1085
00:49:03,752 --> 00:49:07,823
It hit me today...

1086
00:49:07,823 --> 00:49:12,761
that I may have been trying too hard...

1087
00:49:12,761 --> 00:49:14,963
to win her over.

1088
00:49:14,963 --> 00:49:16,365
You don't have to.

1089
00:49:16,365 --> 00:49:19,134
That'll only push Jeong Yoon farther away.

1090
00:49:20,936 --> 00:49:22,104
He must like In Kwon.

1091
00:49:22,104 --> 00:49:23,572
It seems that way.

1092
00:49:23,572 --> 00:49:25,541
He's even giving him advice.

1093
00:49:25,908 --> 00:49:28,410
I should just relax and be myself.

1094
00:49:28,410 --> 00:49:32,481
If I can spend
the rest of my time here like that,

1095
00:49:32,481 --> 00:49:33,415
if that is possible...

1096
00:49:33,415 --> 00:49:35,217
I'd like you to try that.

1097
00:49:35,217 --> 00:49:36,051
I'll try.

1098
00:49:36,051 --> 00:49:39,555
It'll help you get to know
each other better.

1099
00:49:39,555 --> 00:49:41,924
He seemed completely genuine.

1100
00:49:42,825 --> 00:49:44,593
He spoke from the heart,

1101
00:49:44,593 --> 00:49:47,262
and if Jeong Yoon truly likes him,

1102
00:49:47,262 --> 00:49:48,998
then I'm okay with him too.

1103
00:49:48,998 --> 00:49:50,399
My goodness.

1104
00:49:50,733 --> 00:49:51,800
(Kang Shin Woo's father
and Kim Da Hye talk alone.)

1105
00:49:51,800 --> 00:49:54,536
Please ask me anything you'd like.

1106
00:49:54,536 --> 00:49:56,105
What do you think of Shin Woo?

1107
00:49:56,722 --> 00:49:58,057
About Shin Woo,

1108
00:49:58,057 --> 00:50:00,426
I feel that if he had a family of his own,

1109
00:50:00,426 --> 00:50:04,129
he'd be very responsible
and devoted to them.

1110
00:50:05,130 --> 00:50:05,838
That's right.

1111
00:50:05,839 --> 00:50:08,334
He has a great sense of responsibility
for his parents too.

1112
00:50:08,334 --> 00:50:10,703
Yes. I noticed that.

1113
00:50:10,703 --> 00:50:12,905
It's only been a few days,
but I can already tell.

1114
00:50:13,372 --> 00:50:15,274
Then, Da Hye,

1115
00:50:15,274 --> 00:50:17,142
what are your views on marriage?

1116
00:50:17,142 --> 00:50:20,513
What kind of relationship
do you want with your family?

1117
00:50:21,780 --> 00:50:23,816
Actually, I'm religious.

1118
00:50:23,816 --> 00:50:26,085
I'm a Christian,

1119
00:50:26,085 --> 00:50:30,723
so it shapes how I think about marriage.

1120
00:50:30,723 --> 00:50:33,993
But I'd never force my faith
on my partner.

1121
00:50:34,326 --> 00:50:38,697
If your partner had a different faith,

1122
00:50:38,697 --> 00:50:43,102
that could lead to conflict.

1123
00:50:43,102 --> 00:50:45,704
How would you deal with that?

1124
00:50:48,240 --> 00:50:50,876
I've come to understand...

1125
00:50:50,876 --> 00:50:52,711
that faith isn't something you can force.

1126
00:50:52,711 --> 00:50:55,414
People have to choose for themselves...

1127
00:50:55,414 --> 00:50:58,317
and believe in what makes them happy.

1128
00:50:58,317 --> 00:51:01,554
I believe in respecting
each other's beliefs too.

1129
00:51:02,521 --> 00:51:03,622
In relationships,

1130
00:51:05,791 --> 00:51:08,427
you need to draw a clear line.

1131
00:51:09,028 --> 00:51:13,065
If you don't like someone
but let yourself be swept along...

1132
00:51:13,065 --> 00:51:15,234
just because they like you,

1133
00:51:15,568 --> 00:51:18,604
the relationship can turn unhealthy.

1134
00:51:19,205 --> 00:51:23,209
Perhaps his father sensed that.
Don't you think?

1135
00:51:23,209 --> 00:51:27,279
I think he noticed something.

1136
00:51:27,279 --> 00:51:31,584
It felt like he was subtly
giving her a hint.

1137
00:51:32,017 --> 00:51:34,420
If two people aren't compatible,

1138
00:51:34,420 --> 00:51:36,388
I think it's best to end things sooner.

1139
00:51:36,388 --> 00:51:38,057
I see.

1140
00:51:38,057 --> 00:51:41,493
- You may disagree.
- No. I'll take that to heart.

1141
00:51:41,493 --> 00:51:44,230
Shin Woo's father asked me...

1142
00:51:44,230 --> 00:51:47,233
what I'd do
if I dated someone of another faith.

1143
00:51:47,233 --> 00:51:48,400
My values...

1144
00:51:48,400 --> 00:51:51,270
are deeply rooted in my Christian beliefs,

1145
00:51:51,270 --> 00:51:55,641
so I realized I'd set aside
what mattered most to me...

1146
00:51:55,641 --> 00:51:57,576
when I came here...

1147
00:51:57,576 --> 00:52:01,347
and let the situation carry me along.

1148
00:52:01,347 --> 00:52:04,717
That realization made things
very difficult for me.

1149
00:52:06,385 --> 00:52:09,622
You came all this way
to find your son a partner.

1150
00:52:09,622 --> 00:52:10,923
I'm truly grateful.

1151
00:52:10,923 --> 00:52:12,024
The night view is beautiful.

1152
00:52:12,024 --> 00:52:13,459
It's a nice place for a walk.

1153
00:52:13,959 --> 00:52:15,261
The weather is nice today too.

1154
00:52:16,028 --> 00:52:18,664
The view over there is gorgeous.

1155
00:52:18,664 --> 00:52:20,399
(The three sit beneath
the beautiful night sky.)

1156
00:52:21,567 --> 00:52:25,371
I like everything about her. It's just...

1157
00:52:25,371 --> 00:52:28,040
the religious issue.

1158
00:52:28,040 --> 00:52:29,575
Right.

1159
00:52:29,575 --> 00:52:32,044
I'm still not religious,

1160
00:52:32,044 --> 00:52:33,078
and I don't intend to convert.

1161
00:52:33,078 --> 00:52:35,181
As long as you accept each other.

1162
00:52:35,181 --> 00:52:38,117
I think I can do that.

1163
00:52:38,117 --> 00:52:40,152
The more Da Hye speaks,

1164
00:52:40,152 --> 00:52:42,321
the more mature she seems.

1165
00:52:42,321 --> 00:52:44,323
Honestly, it feels like...

1166
00:52:44,323 --> 00:52:46,025
I'm sitting across from a saint.

1167
00:52:46,992 --> 00:52:49,628
It almost made me wonder
if that's the power of faith.

1168
00:52:49,628 --> 00:52:51,697
The way I see it, Shin Woo...

1169
00:52:51,697 --> 00:52:54,200
would go to church tomorrow
if she asked him to.

1170
00:52:54,200 --> 00:52:55,467
Right?

1171
00:52:55,467 --> 00:52:58,337
Although he's saying that
in front of his parents.

1172
00:52:58,337 --> 00:53:00,272
But seeing that side of her...

1173
00:53:00,272 --> 00:53:04,343
actually helped me understand
people of other faiths better.

1174
00:53:05,144 --> 00:53:08,214
I don't think you need to worry too much.

1175
00:53:08,214 --> 00:53:10,749
Our son goes all in
when he wants something.

1176
00:53:10,749 --> 00:53:13,285
But if someone
only charges straight ahead,

1177
00:53:13,285 --> 00:53:15,054
the other person may get tired of it.

1178
00:53:16,889 --> 00:53:17,857
They might want to put on the brakes.

1179
00:53:17,857 --> 00:53:20,025
- She read him perfectly.
- Exactly.

1180
00:53:20,626 --> 00:53:24,163
Mom understands that better
because she's a woman.

1181
00:53:24,997 --> 00:53:26,699
You shouldn't pressure the other person.

1182
00:53:26,699 --> 00:53:28,033
I've tried not to.

1183
00:53:28,033 --> 00:53:29,969
She also...

1184
00:53:29,969 --> 00:53:32,705
needed a chance
to meet the other four men.

1185
00:53:32,705 --> 00:53:35,574
I did give her that chance.

1186
00:53:35,574 --> 00:53:37,443
I told her to go meet everyone else...

1187
00:53:37,443 --> 00:53:39,245
and said I'd still be the best choice.

1188
00:53:39,245 --> 00:53:40,579
I said it confidently.

1189
00:53:40,579 --> 00:53:43,048
Ultimately, the decision is hers.

1190
00:53:44,049 --> 00:53:46,252
Honestly, I was taken aback.

1191
00:53:46,252 --> 00:53:48,020
As a parent,

1192
00:53:48,020 --> 00:53:50,589
I felt it was something...

1193
00:53:50,589 --> 00:53:52,224
we needed to address carefully.

1194
00:53:52,224 --> 00:53:54,894
That worried me a little.

1195
00:53:55,628 --> 00:53:58,864
I don't think Shin Woo has noticed
how Da Hye feels,

1196
00:53:58,864 --> 00:54:01,967
and he just keeps charging ahead.

1197
00:54:01,967 --> 00:54:03,969
Da Hye must know...

1198
00:54:03,969 --> 00:54:07,273
that this man would truly love her,

1199
00:54:07,273 --> 00:54:08,340
do everything he could for her,

1200
00:54:08,340 --> 00:54:11,410
and make her very happy.

1201
00:54:11,410 --> 00:54:14,680
But I think this is exactly why
she keeps wavering.

1202
00:54:14,680 --> 00:54:16,782
She's missing that romantic spark.

1203
00:54:16,782 --> 00:54:21,554
I don't think
she feels enough romantic attraction.

1204
00:54:21,554 --> 00:54:23,355
I think that's what it is.

1205
00:54:26,292 --> 00:54:28,561
When Ha Yoon's mother walked in earlier,

1206
00:54:28,561 --> 00:54:31,730
she didn't look very happy.

1207
00:54:31,730 --> 00:54:32,731
Why?

1208
00:54:32,731 --> 00:54:35,434
I don't know.
I think the distance is bothering her.

1209
00:54:36,468 --> 00:54:37,803
Stop bringing up the distance.

1210
00:54:42,908 --> 00:54:44,743
When? When she came in?

1211
00:54:44,743 --> 00:54:46,612
(Nod)

1212
00:54:47,980 --> 00:54:49,949
Dong Young's on edge now too.

1213
00:54:49,949 --> 00:54:51,016
Of course, he is.

1214
00:54:51,317 --> 00:54:54,320
(The mood turns heavy in an instant.)

1215
00:54:54,854 --> 00:54:57,189
What did you think
after talking to Ha Yoon?

1216
00:54:58,057 --> 00:55:00,092
Ha Yoon?

1217
00:55:00,092 --> 00:55:04,296
She seemed like a really wonderful person.

1218
00:55:05,331 --> 00:55:06,599
(Smile)

1219
00:55:06,599 --> 00:55:08,734
(His lips curl up at the compliment.)

1220
00:55:08,734 --> 00:55:11,570
The problem is,
Ha Yoon's mother has to like him.

1221
00:55:11,570 --> 00:55:13,572
If she won't choose him, this can't work.

1222
00:55:13,572 --> 00:55:14,740
That's what's hard.

1223
00:55:15,341 --> 00:55:18,010
The distance is the biggest disadvantage.

1224
00:55:18,010 --> 00:55:19,078
So...

1225
00:55:20,579 --> 00:55:22,214
I don't see it that way.

1226
00:55:22,214 --> 00:55:24,283
Honestly, who knows?

1227
00:55:24,283 --> 00:55:28,621
Everyone keeps asking, and it's always
long-distance this, long-distance that.

1228
00:55:28,621 --> 00:55:29,722
So...

1229
00:55:29,722 --> 00:55:32,424
all that pressure...

1230
00:55:32,424 --> 00:55:34,827
is starting to get to me.

1231
00:55:35,661 --> 00:55:37,730
In this tiny country,

1232
00:55:38,831 --> 00:55:40,299
I mean,

1233
00:55:40,299 --> 00:55:43,836
people date
from opposite sides of the world.

1234
00:55:44,436 --> 00:55:47,673
From what Ha Yoon told me,

1235
00:55:48,307 --> 00:55:50,910
our conversation ended on a good note.

1236
00:55:50,910 --> 00:55:52,811
But her mother may still be worried.

1237
00:55:52,811 --> 00:55:55,047
That's the wildcard.

1238
00:55:55,481 --> 00:55:57,283
I don't know where she stands.

1239
00:55:58,517 --> 00:56:00,819
The distance issue
isn't completely resolved.

1240
00:56:01,620 --> 00:56:04,156
What he said earlier...

1241
00:56:04,156 --> 00:56:06,258
Mom, your face went completely blank.

1242
00:56:06,859 --> 00:56:09,929
Your expression scared me,
so I told you to smile.

1243
00:56:09,929 --> 00:56:11,864
Really? Did I make that kind of face?

1244
00:56:11,864 --> 00:56:13,933
You were sitting there like this.

1245
00:56:13,933 --> 00:56:17,870
Really? I was so...

1246
00:56:17,870 --> 00:56:20,139
You looked like that
for about ten seconds.

1247
00:56:20,139 --> 00:56:21,440
I was startled.

1248
00:56:21,440 --> 00:56:23,576
I knew nothing...

1249
00:56:23,576 --> 00:56:25,578
when I opened the door...

1250
00:56:27,246 --> 00:56:28,380
And he was there again.

1251
00:56:28,380 --> 00:56:31,217
I was so shocked to see Dong Young.

1252
00:56:31,217 --> 00:56:33,986
- In that situation...
- Who did you expect to see?

1253
00:56:33,986 --> 00:56:37,456
I thought it'd be another group date,
at least two-on-one.

1254
00:56:37,456 --> 00:56:39,024
- With Ye Chan?
- Yes.

1255
00:56:39,024 --> 00:56:41,160
That's what I thought...

1256
00:56:41,160 --> 00:56:43,863
when I walked in.

1257
00:56:44,997 --> 00:56:46,799
Dong Young came back this morning.

1258
00:56:46,799 --> 00:56:47,933
Really?

1259
00:56:47,933 --> 00:56:52,204
He apologized
for being too hasty yesterday.

1260
00:56:52,204 --> 00:56:53,005
Really?

1261
00:56:53,005 --> 00:56:56,342
I guess ending it upset me...

1262
00:56:56,876 --> 00:56:58,143
more than I expected.

1263
00:56:58,143 --> 00:56:59,144
Did it?

1264
00:56:59,879 --> 00:57:00,713
So...

1265
00:57:00,713 --> 00:57:01,647
I see.

1266
00:57:03,182 --> 00:57:05,784
- Were you very angry?
- No.

1267
00:57:05,784 --> 00:57:07,353
This is awful.

1268
00:57:08,320 --> 00:57:11,724
Ha Yoon's mother must have
a lot on her mind too.

1269
00:57:12,358 --> 00:57:14,727
I was worried about Mom.

1270
00:57:16,395 --> 00:57:19,365
Mom was smiling,

1271
00:57:19,365 --> 00:57:22,001
but in that moment,

1272
00:57:22,001 --> 00:57:26,205
I knew exactly
what she was thinking inside.

1273
00:57:26,205 --> 00:57:29,608
Ha Yoon chose Dong Young.

1274
00:57:30,643 --> 00:57:31,644
She did,

1275
00:57:31,644 --> 00:57:33,512
but I don't know...

1276
00:57:34,413 --> 00:57:38,417
if I can support Ha Yoon's choice...

1277
00:57:38,417 --> 00:57:42,054
or if everything that concerns me...

1278
00:57:42,054 --> 00:57:43,455
will make supporting her impossible.

1279
00:57:44,156 --> 00:57:46,559
That's what's still unresolved.

1280
00:57:48,227 --> 00:57:51,363
Ha Yoon's mother seemed so firm...

1281
00:57:51,363 --> 00:57:53,499
that I wonder if they can overcome
the distance issue.

1282
00:57:53,499 --> 00:57:57,903
Parents usually give in to their children,

1283
00:57:57,903 --> 00:58:00,439
but I think this show may be different.

1284
00:58:00,439 --> 00:58:01,240
Because...

1285
00:58:01,240 --> 00:58:04,610
the parents might think,

1286
00:58:04,610 --> 00:58:07,213
"This won't work,
so I have to stop it here."

1287
00:58:07,213 --> 00:58:08,814
That's possible.

1288
00:58:08,814 --> 00:58:09,715
Right.

1289
00:58:11,083 --> 00:58:14,486
My rankings change
with every conversation here.

1290
00:58:14,486 --> 00:58:16,188
- Really?
- That's how you get to know each other.

1291
00:58:16,188 --> 00:58:19,391
I was down to two men.
There was someone else I liked too.

1292
00:58:19,391 --> 00:58:21,060
What does he do?

1293
00:58:21,060 --> 00:58:22,228
He's an announcer.

1294
00:58:22,228 --> 00:58:24,196
That was him. But now...

1295
00:58:24,196 --> 00:58:27,700
I originally liked the announcer
more than him.

1296
00:58:27,700 --> 00:58:29,201
He was third.

1297
00:58:29,201 --> 00:58:32,404
But I don't see
any practical obstacles with Ye Chan.

1298
00:58:32,404 --> 00:58:35,307
He's a lawyer with a stable career.

1299
00:58:35,307 --> 00:58:37,576
But we're not at the point yet...

1300
00:58:37,576 --> 00:58:39,378
where I'd say
our romantic chemistry is great.

1301
00:58:41,046 --> 00:58:42,081
As for In Kwon,

1302
00:58:43,682 --> 00:58:46,318
I just can't get him out of my mind.

1303
00:58:46,318 --> 00:58:48,654
Maybe because I've liked him
since the first-impression vote.

1304
00:58:49,355 --> 00:58:53,492
Even during the family date,
I had to wait alone,

1305
00:58:53,492 --> 00:58:55,394
and it made me uneasy.

1306
00:58:55,394 --> 00:58:57,396
I kept thinking about him.

1307
00:58:57,396 --> 00:58:59,899
I wondered, "Why is he on my mind?"

1308
00:58:59,899 --> 00:59:02,735
It's not that
I'm not attracted to Ye Chan.

1309
00:59:02,735 --> 00:59:03,936
I do,

1310
00:59:03,936 --> 00:59:06,438
and he's a great choice
in every practical sense.

1311
00:59:06,438 --> 00:59:09,208
Still, I kept thinking about In Kwon.

1312
00:59:09,208 --> 00:59:12,244
Even I wondered,
"Why do I keep thinking of him?"

1313
00:59:13,012 --> 00:59:14,446
Then he's your number one.

1314
00:59:14,446 --> 00:59:15,648
Exactly.

1315
00:59:15,648 --> 00:59:17,650
The person on your mind
is your top choice.

1316
00:59:18,817 --> 00:59:21,620
(Ye Chan visits Shin Woo after the date.)

1317
00:59:21,854 --> 00:59:23,889
I'm still down to two women.

1318
00:59:23,889 --> 00:59:25,958
Jeong Yoon and Do Yoon?

1319
00:59:25,958 --> 00:59:28,327
Jeong Yoon has a lot of suitors.

1320
00:59:28,327 --> 00:59:29,495
A lot of men are pursuing her.

1321
00:59:29,829 --> 00:59:31,897
Seong Mo is all in on her,

1322
00:59:31,897 --> 00:59:36,101
and I think In Kwon is too.

1323
00:59:36,101 --> 00:59:39,104
Normally, I'd think...

1324
00:59:39,104 --> 00:59:41,540
why join a bloodbath...

1325
00:59:41,540 --> 00:59:43,676
when two men are already
competing for her?

1326
00:59:43,676 --> 00:59:44,910
But...

1327
00:59:44,910 --> 00:59:46,378
what makes this situation unique...

1328
00:59:46,378 --> 00:59:49,281
is that our mothers are involved.

1329
00:59:49,281 --> 00:59:52,718
You could even talk
to the other person's mother.

1330
00:59:52,718 --> 00:59:55,788
Like asking Jeong Yoon's mother...

1331
00:59:55,788 --> 00:59:57,590
to have a conversation?

1332
00:59:57,590 --> 01:00:00,860
Shin Woo isn't in a position
to coach anyone right now.

1333
01:00:00,860 --> 01:00:03,128
He needs to worry about himself.

1334
01:00:03,128 --> 01:00:05,531
I should go talk
to Jeong Yoon's mother now.

1335
01:00:05,531 --> 01:00:06,699
Before it's too late.

1336
01:00:07,800 --> 01:00:10,002
He's going to see her mother?

1337
01:00:10,002 --> 01:00:11,237
Not Jeong Yoon?

1338
01:00:12,204 --> 01:00:14,340
You really do have insight.

1339
01:00:14,340 --> 01:00:15,241
Insight?

1340
01:00:16,342 --> 01:00:18,611
What are you talking about
that's so interesting?

1341
01:00:18,611 --> 01:00:20,346
- Do you want to join us?
- Come talk with us.

1342
01:00:20,346 --> 01:00:21,714
- Shall we talk?
- Come in.

1343
01:00:21,714 --> 01:00:24,450
(Do Yoon and Da Hye happen to be talking
in Jeong Yoon's room.)

1344
01:00:24,450 --> 01:00:25,584
Now this is awkward.

1345
01:00:26,952 --> 01:00:29,221
(Flustered)

1346
01:00:29,221 --> 01:00:32,658
I actually didn't come to see you.

1347
01:00:32,658 --> 01:00:34,059
I came to see someone else.

1348
01:00:35,528 --> 01:00:37,229
That's honest.

1349
01:00:37,229 --> 01:00:39,365
Will you do what you came to do,

1350
01:00:39,365 --> 01:00:40,599
or stay and talk with everyone?

1351
01:00:40,855 --> 01:00:43,725
Is Jeong Yoon's mother here?

1352
01:00:43,725 --> 01:00:44,792
She's inside.

1353
01:00:45,727 --> 01:00:46,427
Call her.

1354
01:00:46,427 --> 01:00:47,895
Ms. Go?

1355
01:00:48,329 --> 01:00:49,464
You have a visitor.

1356
01:00:49,464 --> 01:00:50,598
Hello.

1357
01:00:51,283 --> 01:00:52,518
Were you already washed up and resting?

1358
01:00:52,518 --> 01:00:53,685
No.

1359
01:00:53,685 --> 01:00:54,520
It's fine.

1360
01:00:55,487 --> 01:00:57,422
I actually came to see you.

1361
01:00:57,422 --> 01:00:58,323
Me?

1362
01:00:58,323 --> 01:00:59,191
Yes.

1363
01:00:59,191 --> 01:01:00,459
Me?

1364
01:01:00,459 --> 01:01:03,061
I came hoping to speak with you
for a moment, Ms. Go.

1365
01:01:03,061 --> 01:01:05,063
- I'm sorry this is so sudden.
- Just a moment.

1366
01:01:05,764 --> 01:01:06,532
Isn't this a first for the show?

1367
01:01:06,532 --> 01:01:08,700
- This is something new.
- It is.

1368
01:01:08,700 --> 01:01:09,835
This is definitely new.

1369
01:01:09,835 --> 01:01:11,403
It's something only this show can offer.

1370
01:01:11,403 --> 01:01:13,806
But have you actually talked
to Jeong Yoon?

1371
01:01:13,806 --> 01:01:15,007
Is it because she hasn't been around?

1372
01:01:15,007 --> 01:01:16,975
We haven't had a proper conversation yet.

1373
01:01:16,975 --> 01:01:18,143
- Exactly.
- Right.

1374
01:01:18,143 --> 01:01:21,013
He hasn't even spoken
one-on-one with Jeong Yoon.

1375
01:01:21,013 --> 01:01:24,416
Exactly. What is happening?

1376
01:01:25,884 --> 01:01:27,119
(Jeong Yoon's mother comes out
after getting ready.)

1377
01:01:27,119 --> 01:01:28,387
I look a mess.

1378
01:01:28,387 --> 01:01:30,122
Not at all. You look beautiful, ma'am.

1379
01:01:30,122 --> 01:01:31,290
We should give them some privacy.

1380
01:01:31,290 --> 01:01:32,724
You can talk here.

1381
01:01:33,358 --> 01:01:35,627
(They all rush out.)

1382
01:01:35,627 --> 01:01:37,529
- Have a lovely time.
- Thank you.

1383
01:01:38,397 --> 01:01:39,565
Hello, Ms. Go.

1384
01:01:40,299 --> 01:01:41,500
You must be caught off guard.

1385
01:01:41,500 --> 01:01:42,434
Yes.

1386
01:01:43,368 --> 01:01:46,004
I'm sorry to drop in so suddenly.

1387
01:01:46,672 --> 01:01:47,706
The truth is...

1388
01:01:48,974 --> 01:01:51,410
one of the women...

1389
01:01:51,410 --> 01:01:54,746
- I'm interested in is Jeong Yoon.
- I see.

1390
01:01:55,114 --> 01:01:59,818
Our timing never lined up
for a one-on-one talk.

1391
01:01:59,818 --> 01:02:04,523
Jeong Yoon said
you hadn't had a deep conversation.

1392
01:02:04,523 --> 01:02:08,760
I was disappointed about that too.

1393
01:02:09,294 --> 01:02:15,767
But if Jeong Yoon has decided
to pursue In Kwon...

1394
01:02:15,767 --> 01:02:18,203
I'm not sure about that yet.

1395
01:02:19,171 --> 01:02:20,839
The way I see it,

1396
01:02:21,507 --> 01:02:23,942
perhaps you haven't expressed
your interest either.

1397
01:02:23,942 --> 01:02:24,810
Right.

1398
01:02:24,810 --> 01:02:26,345
We never found the time to talk.

1399
01:02:26,345 --> 01:02:27,479
- Is that so?
- Not yet.

1400
01:02:27,880 --> 01:02:31,316
You've been here several days.
You could've gone to see her.

1401
01:02:31,316 --> 01:02:33,385
Her mother sees right through him.

1402
01:02:33,385 --> 01:02:34,620
If he'd really wanted to...

1403
01:02:34,620 --> 01:02:36,688
Exactly. If he'd really wanted to...

1404
01:02:36,688 --> 01:02:38,991
- He could've talked in the morning.
- Or before bed.

1405
01:02:38,991 --> 01:02:41,193
There was plenty of time.

1406
01:02:41,193 --> 01:02:47,166
But he spent all his time
obsessing over gathering information.

1407
01:02:47,566 --> 01:02:51,203
You didn't choose Jeong Yoon
when the men made their choices.

1408
01:02:51,203 --> 01:02:54,373
Right. That's where things went wrong.

1409
01:02:55,240 --> 01:02:57,609
When something similar
happened to another man,

1410
01:02:57,609 --> 01:03:01,914
he came by later
because he wanted to talk.

1411
01:03:01,914 --> 01:03:03,348
That's what happened.

1412
01:03:03,982 --> 01:03:06,552
But with you, Ye Chan,
it seems they never even had...

1413
01:03:06,552 --> 01:03:09,021
that kind of opportunity. Right?

1414
01:03:09,922 --> 01:03:11,323
Her mother is practically scolding him.

1415
01:03:11,323 --> 01:03:12,591
It feels like a scolding.

1416
01:03:12,591 --> 01:03:14,626
You kept hesitating
without giving her any signals.

1417
01:03:14,626 --> 01:03:15,961
So she might have thought,

1418
01:03:15,961 --> 01:03:20,299
"Is that all he feels for me?"
Don't you think?

1419
01:03:20,299 --> 01:03:22,401
If you never came by,
she could think you weren't curious.

1420
01:03:22,401 --> 01:03:24,536
She's saying such wise things.

1421
01:03:24,536 --> 01:03:25,971
He has no comeback.

1422
01:03:26,271 --> 01:03:29,274
I thought we'd eventually talk
one-on-one naturally,

1423
01:03:29,274 --> 01:03:30,709
and that being a day or two late...

1424
01:03:30,709 --> 01:03:35,280
wouldn't matter.

1425
01:03:35,280 --> 01:03:36,882
But in a place like this,

1426
01:03:36,882 --> 01:03:39,284
even a day or two made a huge difference.

1427
01:03:39,284 --> 01:03:41,887
Even so,

1428
01:03:41,887 --> 01:03:43,789
I want to have an honest conversation
with Jeong Yoon.

1429
01:03:45,624 --> 01:03:46,592
Are you in there?

1430
01:03:48,727 --> 01:03:51,697
(Ye Chan's mother visits Da Hye's room.)

1431
01:03:51,697 --> 01:03:53,999
I actually wanted to talk to you too.

1432
01:03:53,999 --> 01:03:54,833
About what?

1433
01:03:54,833 --> 01:03:57,669
I wanted us to have a private talk.

1434
01:03:57,669 --> 01:03:59,772
How can it be private
when we're wearing microphones?

1435
01:04:00,305 --> 01:04:01,740
How was it?

1436
01:04:01,740 --> 01:04:02,975
I was shocked.

1437
01:04:04,243 --> 01:04:06,445
- His father came too, right?
- Yes.

1438
01:04:06,445 --> 01:04:08,313
Honestly,

1439
01:04:08,313 --> 01:04:11,283
Shin Woo must really be into Da Hye.

1440
01:04:11,283 --> 01:04:13,352
We all know. He really does.

1441
01:04:13,352 --> 01:04:14,887
He definitely likes her.

1442
01:04:14,887 --> 01:04:15,621
But...

1443
01:04:15,621 --> 01:04:18,090
in the middle of that family meeting,

1444
01:04:18,090 --> 01:04:19,792
he started talking about marriage.

1445
01:04:19,792 --> 01:04:21,393
- At the family meeting?
- Yes.

1446
01:04:21,627 --> 01:04:23,328
He's getting impatient.

1447
01:04:23,829 --> 01:04:25,764
He doesn't want to lose Da Hye.

1448
01:04:25,764 --> 01:04:27,332
That's dangerous.

1449
01:04:27,332 --> 01:04:30,369
It's only been a few days,
and he's thinking about marriage.

1450
01:04:30,369 --> 01:04:31,637
Am I wrong?

1451
01:04:33,605 --> 01:04:35,774
Well, he can feel that way.

1452
01:04:35,774 --> 01:04:37,709
The first thing we want
is someone who's Christian.

1453
01:04:38,110 --> 01:04:39,912
"Meet Ye Chan. Give him a chance."

1454
01:04:39,912 --> 01:04:42,047
Right. She should meet him.

1455
01:04:42,915 --> 01:04:43,816
Yes?

1456
01:04:43,816 --> 01:04:45,584
I didn't know you were here.

1457
01:04:45,584 --> 01:04:47,753
I came to visit. I just stopped by.

1458
01:04:47,753 --> 01:04:50,155
I'm so glad you're here.

1459
01:04:50,155 --> 01:04:51,924
My mom isn't here.

1460
01:04:51,924 --> 01:04:53,459
How much did you talk about?

1461
01:04:53,459 --> 01:04:55,360
I talked with Ye Chan yesterday too.

1462
01:04:56,261 --> 01:04:58,697
Even at the pre-show meeting,

1463
01:04:58,697 --> 01:04:59,731
I said I wanted "a believer."

1464
01:04:59,731 --> 01:05:01,800
Because my husband wasn't a believer,

1465
01:05:01,800 --> 01:05:04,603
and it took 20 years of dawn prayers
to bring him to church.

1466
01:05:04,603 --> 01:05:06,472
Even if my husband starts
attending church,

1467
01:05:06,472 --> 01:05:08,740
he may stop again when life gets hard.

1468
01:05:09,074 --> 01:05:12,377
You can't count on him
becoming a believer after marriage.

1469
01:05:12,377 --> 01:05:13,612
That may be how he feels right now.

1470
01:05:13,612 --> 01:05:15,247
It could happen.

1471
01:05:15,247 --> 01:05:17,516
But it may take ten years or even 20.

1472
01:05:17,516 --> 01:05:19,151
That process is hard.

1473
01:05:19,151 --> 01:05:20,052
Right.

1474
01:05:20,052 --> 01:05:23,589
If a married couple gets into a fight,

1475
01:05:23,889 --> 01:05:27,192
our shared faith helps us
resolve it before bed.

1476
01:05:27,192 --> 01:05:28,694
We listen to Scripture.

1477
01:05:28,694 --> 01:05:30,696
That's truly wonderful.

1478
01:05:30,696 --> 01:05:31,763
That's the best.

1479
01:05:31,763 --> 01:05:34,700
We still fall asleep holding hands.

1480
01:05:34,700 --> 01:05:37,836
Ye Chan knows that when he marries,

1481
01:05:37,836 --> 01:05:40,773
his wife should be a Christian.

1482
01:05:40,773 --> 01:05:42,474
This gives her even more to think about.

1483
01:05:42,474 --> 01:05:45,144
I don't know about Da Hye, but Ye Chan...

1484
01:05:45,144 --> 01:05:48,380
Even though his name reflects his faith...

1485
01:05:48,380 --> 01:05:50,582
and he is a Christian,

1486
01:05:51,216 --> 01:05:53,118
but he would never...

1487
01:05:53,118 --> 01:05:55,954
try to change someone because of religion.

1488
01:05:55,954 --> 01:05:56,855
That's right.

1489
01:05:56,855 --> 01:05:59,057
Because from the very beginning,

1490
01:05:59,057 --> 01:06:01,326
you were always among his top choices.

1491
01:06:01,326 --> 01:06:02,795
You were always among his top choices.

1492
01:06:04,897 --> 01:06:06,498
But he never made a move?

1493
01:06:06,498 --> 01:06:08,600
Our timing never worked out.

1494
01:06:08,600 --> 01:06:10,369
I was always talking with Shin Woo.

1495
01:06:10,369 --> 01:06:12,638
Ye Chan wanted to talk.

1496
01:06:12,638 --> 01:06:14,106
So...

1497
01:06:14,106 --> 01:06:15,607
when I was given the private conversation,

1498
01:06:15,607 --> 01:06:19,411
I decided I should talk to her.

1499
01:06:20,112 --> 01:06:22,848
Does Ye Chan care a lot about looks?

1500
01:06:22,848 --> 01:06:24,683
He does.

1501
01:06:25,083 --> 01:06:28,387
That's why he liked Da Hye.

1502
01:06:28,387 --> 01:06:30,989
At first, only two women caught his eye.

1503
01:06:30,989 --> 01:06:33,459
Do Yoon wasn't one of them.

1504
01:06:34,126 --> 01:06:37,296
Shin Woo was completely smitten
with Da Hye.

1505
01:06:37,296 --> 01:06:38,363
So Ye Chan never had a chance
to talk to her.

1506
01:06:38,363 --> 01:06:39,431
Exactly.

1507
01:06:39,431 --> 01:06:41,767
Strangely, there were no opportunities.

1508
01:06:44,303 --> 01:06:48,941
She's completely misleading Da Hye
and her mother.

1509
01:06:48,941 --> 01:06:51,610
After hearing what Ye Chan's mother said,

1510
01:06:51,610 --> 01:06:55,614
she may think
Ye Chan has feelings for her,

1511
01:06:55,614 --> 01:06:56,682
but that isn't true at all.

1512
01:06:56,682 --> 01:07:00,385
Ye Chan's mother
is simply very fond of Da Hye.

1513
01:07:00,385 --> 01:07:03,188
She came because she wants them together.

1514
01:07:04,022 --> 01:07:07,226
Honestly, hearing you today...

1515
01:07:07,226 --> 01:07:08,560
was a bit of a wake-up call.

1516
01:07:08,560 --> 01:07:11,497
I wondered what I was doing here.

1517
01:07:11,497 --> 01:07:13,866
I came here talking about God,

1518
01:07:13,866 --> 01:07:17,102
but having someone approach me
made me wonder,

1519
01:07:17,703 --> 01:07:20,539
"Should I really move forward...

1520
01:07:20,539 --> 01:07:23,642
by compromising the beliefs I've held?"

1521
01:07:23,642 --> 01:07:25,677
That conversation made me question things.

1522
01:07:25,677 --> 01:07:26,645
Right now...

1523
01:07:27,613 --> 01:07:31,650
As you can see, Shin Woo is so sincere...

1524
01:07:31,650 --> 01:07:34,620
that every choice I make
gives him more certainty.

1525
01:07:34,620 --> 01:07:36,455
Realizing that...

1526
01:07:36,455 --> 01:07:38,290
made me feel a little pressured.

1527
01:07:38,290 --> 01:07:41,293
That's what I was about to tell him.

1528
01:07:41,293 --> 01:07:43,028
If it isn't going to happen,
I need to draw the line soon...

1529
01:07:43,028 --> 01:07:45,631
even one day sooner.
Honestly, I'm already too late.

1530
01:07:45,631 --> 01:07:47,299
The fact that I realized that...

1531
01:07:48,567 --> 01:07:51,136
That conversation turned out
to be incredibly important.

1532
01:07:51,136 --> 01:07:52,471
What now?

1533
01:07:52,471 --> 01:07:54,940
Ye Chan's mother came...

1534
01:07:54,940 --> 01:07:57,276
and gave Da Hye and her mother...

1535
01:07:57,276 --> 01:07:59,678
completely the wrong idea.

1536
01:07:59,678 --> 01:08:02,714
This was one risky conversation.

1537
01:08:03,348 --> 01:08:05,918
I decided I should just be honest.

1538
01:08:05,918 --> 01:08:07,686
Even if I don't choose anyone in the end,

1539
01:08:07,686 --> 01:08:11,190
I should let Shin Woo consider
other possibilities...

1540
01:08:11,190 --> 01:08:13,325
even one day sooner.

1541
01:08:13,325 --> 01:08:15,194
I think Shin Woo will be hurt.

1542
01:08:15,194 --> 01:08:19,431
But it's better than dragging it out
for 5 days and rejecting him at the end.

1543
01:08:19,431 --> 01:08:22,134
I think telling him sooner
is the right thing to do.

1544
01:08:22,534 --> 01:08:24,703
He'll be so hurt.

1545
01:08:24,703 --> 01:08:25,704
Da Hye.

1546
01:08:26,205 --> 01:08:27,172
Da Hye.

1547
01:08:28,407 --> 01:08:29,675
My gosh.

1548
01:08:30,609 --> 01:08:32,077
Of all times...

1549
01:08:32,077 --> 01:08:33,612
"Da Hye."

1550
01:08:33,612 --> 01:08:35,647
Shin Woo just showed up.

1551
01:08:35,647 --> 01:08:36,815
Da Hye.

1552
01:08:36,815 --> 01:08:37,883
(Startled)

1553
01:08:37,883 --> 01:08:38,884
Da Hye.

1554
01:08:39,551 --> 01:08:40,786
- Who is it?
- Shin Woo.

1555
01:08:40,786 --> 01:08:41,787
Da Hye.

1556
01:08:41,787 --> 01:08:42,988
Yes?

1557
01:08:42,988 --> 01:08:47,860
The moment of truth is almost here.

1558
01:08:50,162 --> 01:08:52,664
Honestly, my faith is stronger
than you might think.

1559
01:08:52,664 --> 01:08:54,399
I'd wanted us
to go to church together too.

1560
01:08:54,399 --> 01:08:56,802
Could this be part of the Lord's plan?

1561
01:08:56,802 --> 01:08:58,170
He's practically a believer already.

1562
01:08:58,170 --> 01:09:00,172
Have you made up your mind now?

1563
01:09:00,172 --> 01:09:01,039
Yes, I have.

1564
01:09:01,039 --> 01:09:02,875
I need to show her I'm going all in.

1565
01:09:02,875 --> 01:09:05,144
I've decided to give it everything I have.

1566
01:09:05,144 --> 01:09:07,679
It gave me more to think about.

1567
01:09:07,679 --> 01:09:10,282
Tomorrow is the day
of the final selection.

1568
01:09:10,282 --> 01:09:12,818
You will have your final consultation.

1569
01:09:12,985 --> 01:09:15,020
(Emotions erupt
after the final consultations.)

1570
01:09:15,020 --> 01:09:16,722
They've completely lost it.

1571
01:09:16,722 --> 01:09:18,390
So what? I said I'll decide for myself.

1572
01:09:18,390 --> 01:09:21,160
I kept choosing her,
but you never chose her once.

1573
01:09:21,160 --> 01:09:22,828
Is he blaming his mom now?

1574
01:09:22,828 --> 01:09:24,496
What's with him?

1575
01:09:24,496 --> 01:09:25,697
Seriously, what's gotten into him?
